  "……好，继续♥": "...Okay, keep going♥",
  // 呼吸-开始
  "一起深呼吸～": "Breathe with me~",
  // 呼吸-吸
  "吸——": "Breathe in—",
  // 呼吸-呼
  "呼——": "Breathe out—",
  // 处决-命令
  "握紧，最后了～": "Grip it, this is the end~",
  // 处决-命令-最后
  "不准停♥": "Don't stop♥",

  // ================= 委托 001 =================
  // 委托单、提示条、定时演出（quest-001.jsonc）
  "冒险者酒场 - 店主": "Adventurers' Tavern - Keeper",
  "电子魅魔Aschan": "Cyber Succubus Aschan",
  "举轻哑铃": "Light dumbbell lifts",
  "加油噢~": "You can do it~",
  "好好跟着节奏♥": "Keep to the rhythm♥",
  "想认输的时候，可以『长按』下方的『放弃』按钮": "Want to surrender? 『Hold』 the 『Give up』 button below",
  "注意右边的『提』『压』标记，这次集中在前端噢": "Watch the 『Up』 and 『Down』 marks on the right. Focus on the tip this time",
  "她好好看": "She's so pretty…",
  "快不行了…": "Can't take much more…",
  "只要能成功坚持到最后，就视为讨伐成功": "Hold out to the very end and the quest is a success",
  // 剧情（story-001.jsonc）
  "领取了「初次任务」的委托后，你独自来到了任务书上指定的地点": "Having taken on the \"First Quest,\" you head alone to the spot named on the quest sheet.",
  "哇，你就是来讨伐Aschan这个邪恶魔物的勇者吧。Aschan才不会乖乖被你打倒呢——（棒读）": "Oh wow, you must be the hero here to slay Aschan, the wicked monster. Aschan won't go down without a fight— (flatly)",
  "……这种事情真的有必要吗？": "…Is this really necessary?",
  "很有必要噢~ 这也算是公会给新人提供的福利之一": "Very necessary~ It's one of the Guild's perks for newcomers.",
  "不仅几乎不会有输掉的风险，还能拿到500G的成功报酬。心怀感激地上吧": "Almost no risk of losing, and a 500G reward if you win. Go on, be grateful.",
  "只是「几乎」不会输噢~": "\"Almost,\" that is~",
  "除非故意投降w": "Unless you surrender on purpose lol",
  "既然如此，我就不客气了！": "In that case, I won't hold back!",
  "凭借强大的意志力，你完成了「初次任务」的讨伐任务": "Through sheer willpower, you complete the \"First Quest.\"",
  "表现很不错呢~ 作为新人冒险者，算是有很努力了": "Not bad at all~ For a rookie adventurer, you really tried.",
  "呼……多谢……": "Phew… thanks…",
  "那么，作为讨伐任务的收尾。来做一下经典的「那个」选择吧~": "Now then, to wrap up the quest. Time for the classic choice~ You know the one.",
  "哎呀~~这么怎么回事呢？": "Oh my~~ What's this now?",
  "好不容易击败的魔物，为什么要选择饶过对方呢~？这样子，之前的努力不就都白费了": "You finally beat the monster, so why spare her~? That throws all your hard work away.",
  "明明是「几乎」不会输的「初次任务」。最后的最后，却无法抵抗败北愿望，选择屈服于自己的m属性认输了吗w": "The \"First Quest\" you \"almost\" couldn't lose. And at the very last moment, you couldn't resist the urge to lose and gave in to your masochist side lol",
  "这样的小变态，作为公会可不能放你出去参加真的讨伐任务哟~": "The Guild can't send a little pervert like you out on real quests~",
  "作为惩罚，你还是放弃成为冒险者的梦想，永远待在这里享受无尽的模拟败北体验好了": "As punishment, give up your dream of adventuring and stay here forever, enjoying endless mock defeats.",
  "认输": "Surrender",
  "面对你成功击败的魔物，要给出最后一击吗~？": "The monster you beat is at your mercy. Deliver the final blow~?",
  // 台词 · 委托开场
  "新人冒险者专用的模拟讨伐。讨伐对象由酒场的秘书担任，请放心挑战。": "A mock subjugation for rookie adventurers only. The target is played by the tavern's secretary, so rest easy.",
  "只要握紧『圣剑』撑过四组，就算讨伐成功。输掉？应该不可能吧。": "Grip your \"Holy Sword\" and hold out for four sets, and the quest is a success. Losing? Surely not.",
  "本委托失败率极低。恐怕只有性癖稍微有点的特殊的冒险者先生才会输掉吧。": "This quest has an extremely low failure rate. Only an adventurer with rather… special tastes could lose.",
  // 台词 · 准备-第1组
  "跟着右边的滑块：好好上下运动吧~": "Follow the slider on the right: nice, steady ups and downs~",
  "第一组很慢的，跟着节奏动就好噢": "Set one is slow. Just move with the rhythm",
  // 台词 · 准备-第2组
  "撑不住的话，长按下面的按钮就能认输的~": "If you can't take it, hold the button below to surrender~",
  "这组Aschan会开始跟你说话了，别失去意志力了噢": "Aschan starts talking this set. Don't lose your willpower",
  // 台词 · 准备-第3组
  "这次滑到只压到一半，好好重点照顾一下前端吧♥": "This time you only go halfway down. Give the tip some extra love♥",
  "视线可不要忍不住乱飘了哟~": "Try not to let your eyes wander~",
  // 台词 · 准备-第4组
  "最后一组了，撑到数字归零就算讨伐成功": "Last set. Hold out till the numbers hit zero and you win",
  "接下来Aschan可不会手下留情啦~": "From here on, Aschan won't go easy on you~",
  // 台词 · 准备
  "准备好了吗？握紧你的『圣剑』": "Ready? Grip your \"Holy Sword\"",
  "深呼吸……然后继续吧~": "Deep breath… now let's keep going~",
  // 台词 · 第1组-前段
  "跟着滑块，提上去、再压下来~": "Follow the slider: up, then down~",
  "慢慢来，按照指示来把控节奏": "Take it slow. Keep the rhythm like it says",
  "很好很好，就是这样~": "Good, good, just like that~",
  // 台词 · 第1组-中段
  "注意，中段开始节奏会变快噢": "Careful, the rhythm speeds up in the middle",
  "跟不上的话，要好好点击放弃来认输哟": "If you can't keep up, give up properly and surrender",
  "嗯嗯，很认真嘛~": "Mm-hm, so diligent~",
  // 台词 · 第2组-前段
  "放轻松，这组还只是热身而已": "Relax, this set is just a warm-up",
  "表情有点紧张呢，要不要Aschan帮你放松一下？": "You look tense. Want Aschan to help you loosen up?",
  "眼睛不要一直盯着Aschan看哟~": "Don't keep staring at Aschan~",
  // 台词 · 第2组-中段
  "最后几秒，想象Aschan在你耳边悄悄倒数~": "For the last few seconds, imagine Aschan counting down in your ear~",
  "手上的动作，越来越让自己舒服了呢~": "Your hand's making you feel better and better~",
  "想放弃的话，长按下面就行啦": "Want to give up? Just hold the button below",
  // 台词 · 第2组-后段
  "马上就撑过这组了，不会在这里认输吧？": "This set's almost over. You won't surrender here, will you?",
  "数字快归零了，再坚持一下~": "The numbers are almost at zero. Hang on~",
  "明明只是模拟战，怎么喘成这样？": "It's only a mock battle. Why are you panting like that?",
  // 台词 · 第3组-前段
  "目光完全是在偷窥Aschan的腿呢，变态~": "You're totally sneaking peeks at Aschan's legs. Pervert~",
  "压到一半就好，把触摸集中在前端噢": "Just halfway down. Focus your touch on the tip",
  "在偷看什么呢~？": "What are you peeking at~?",
  // 台词 · 第3组-中段
  "连脚尖也喜欢吗？真是没救了呢": "You like her toes too? You're hopeless",
  "只照顾前端，是不是反而更难忍了？": "Only the tip… isn't that even harder to endure?",
  "手上的节奏开始乱了噢~": "Your rhythm's getting sloppy~",
  // 台词 · 第3组-后段
  "腿软了的话，认输也没关系哟": "If your legs have gone weak, it's okay to surrender",
  "再看下去，可就不是模拟败北了噢♥": "Keep looking and it won't just be a mock defeat♥",
  "就差一点了，要撑住噢——撑得住吗？": "Almost there. Hold on… can you?",
  // 台词 · 第4组-前段
  "最后一组了，让Aschan认真陪你玩玩吧": "Last set. Let Aschan play with you for real",
  "现在认输的话，还能少丢点脸噢~": "Surrender now and you'll save a little face~",
  "『圣剑』还握得住吗？": "Can you still grip your \"Holy Sword\"?",
  // 台词 · 第4组-中段
  "初次任务可是「几乎」不会输的哟~": "The First Quest is \"almost\" impossible to lose~",
  "再坚持一会儿就讨伐成功了呢": "Hold on a bit longer and you win",
  "你看，Aschan已经靠得这么近了♥": "Look, Aschan's gotten this close♥",
  // 台词 · 第4组-后段
  "都到这里了，输掉的话会被笑话一辈子噢": "Lose after coming this far and you'll be a laughingstock forever",
  "数字还剩多少？不敢看了吧~": "How much time is left? Too scared to look~",
  "放弃吧，Aschan会温柔地判你败北的♥": "Give up. Aschan will declare your defeat so gently♥",
  // 台词 · cutin-前到中-教学
  "节奏要变快了噢！": "It's speeding up!",
  "中段！跟紧节奏！": "Mid-phase! Keep up!",
  // 台词 · cutin-前到中
  "加速了噢~": "Speeding up~",
  "这点速度跟得上吧？": "You can keep up, right?",
  "来，再快一点♥": "Come on, faster♥",
  // 台词 · cutin-中到后
  "最后冲刺~！": "Final sprint~!",
  "要撑不住了吧？": "Can't hold on, can you?",
  "就剩一点点了噢♥": "Just a little more♥",
  // 台词 · 长按中
  "哎呀，要认输了吗~？": "Oh my, surrendering~?",
  "按满就算你败北噢♥": "Fill it up and you lose♥",
  "对，就这样一直按住~": "Yes, just keep holding~",
  // 台词 · 第1组-松手
  "要按满才算放弃噢，别怕按错": "You have to fill it all the way to give up, so don't worry about slips",
  "松开了？那就继续吧~": "Let go? Then let's keep going~",
  // 台词 · 第2组-松手
  "差一点点就认输了呢w": "You almost surrendered lol",
  "刚才手指在发抖噢~": "Your finger was trembling just now~",
  // 台词 · 第3组-松手
  "明明很想按下去的吧？": "You really wanted to press it, didn't you?",
  "下次就别松手了哟♥": "Don't let go next time♥",
  // 台词 · 松手
  "真可惜~差一点就能解脱了": "Too bad~ You were so close to release",
  "还在嘴硬吗？": "Still acting tough?",
  "下次按到底就好啦♥": "Just hold it all the way next time♥",
  // 台词 · 第3组-挑战失手
  "别急，下次看准了再按噢": "Easy. Look carefully before you press next time",
  // 台词 · 暂停-第1组后
  "第一组通过~节奏掌握得不错嘛。下一组Aschan会开始跟你说话，想认输的话长按『放弃』就行噢": "Set one cleared~ You've got a good feel for the rhythm. Next set, Aschan starts talking. To surrender, just hold \"Give up\"",
  "嗯嗯，作为新人还算合格。接下来可要集中注意力，别被Aschan的声音带跑了哟~": "Mm-hm, passable for a rookie. Stay focused from here. Don't let Aschan's voice carry you away~",
  // 台词 · 暂停-第2组后
  "撑过来了呢。下一组只要压到一半，好好照顾一下前端噢♥": "You made it. Next set, just go halfway down and give the tip some love♥",
  "表情已经有点松懈了哟？想要对着一些别的地方挥舞『圣剑』吗~？": "Your face is getting a little loose, isn't it? Want to swing your \"Holy Sword\" at something else~?",
  // 台词 · 暂停-第3组后
  "还剩最后一组。只要坚持到最后就是讨伐成功——不过，真的撑得住吗？": "Just the last set left. Make it to the end and you win… but can you really?",
  "腿好看吗？最后一组Aschan会全力陪你玩，做好心理准备噢~": "Like her legs? Aschan's going all out in the last set. Brace yourself~",
  // 台词 · 暂停
  "休息一下吧~ 接下来还有噢": "Take a breather~ There's more to come",
  // 台词 · 放弃-前段
  "才刚开始就认输了？初次任务的纪录被你刷新了呢w": "Surrendering right at the start? A new First Quest record lol",
  "连热身都撑不过去吗~": "Can't even get through the warm-up~?",
  // 台词 · 放弃-中段
  "节奏一快就投降了呢~": "The moment it sped up, you surrendered~",
  "果然抵挡不住Aschan的声音吗？": "Couldn't resist Aschan's voice after all?",
  // 台词 · 放弃-后段
  "就差一点点，真可惜呢~♥": "So close, too bad~♥",
  "最后几秒最难熬吧？下次再努力噢": "The last few seconds are the hardest, right? Try again next time",
  // 台词 · 撤退
  "这样就放弃了吗？真是没用呢~": "Quitting just like that? How useless~",
  "今天就先放过你，下次再来模拟吧~": "I'll let you off today. Come back for more practice~",
  // 台词 · 败北
  "没跟上噢，模拟败北一次~": "Couldn't keep up. One mock defeat~",
  "失手了呢♥": "You slipped♥",
  // 台词 · 处决-前言
  "明明一般来说是不会输的任务，结果还是主动投降了呢~♥": "A quest you normally can't lose, and you still surrendered~♥",
  "那么，就最后帮你倒数10秒。数到0的时候，要好好彻底『输』出来噢~": "Then let me count down the last 10 seconds for you. When it hits 0, \"lose\" properly, all the way~",
  "不许移开视线，乖乖听Aschan的命令♥": "Don't look away. Be a good boy and obey Aschan♥",
  // 台词 · 处决-cutin
  "倒数开始": "Countdown",
  "要开始数咯♥": "Counting now♥",
  // 台词 · 处决-倒数
  "{n}……": "{n}…",
  "{n}~♥": "{n}~♥",
  "还剩{n}噢~": "{n} left~",
  "{n}，不许逃♥": "{n}, no running♥",
  // 台词 · 处决-心声
  "身体动不了……": "I can't move…",
  "声音好近……": "Her voice is so close…",
  "明明只是模拟战……": "It's only a mock battle…",
  // 台词 · 处决-归零
  "败北♥": "Defeat♥",
  "你输了♥": "You lose♥",
  "模拟败北♥": "Mock defeat♥",
  // 台词 · 处决-结算
  "彻底输掉了呢~ 这次的败北，Aschan会好好记下来噢♥": "Totally defeated~ Aschan will keep a careful record of this loss♥",
  "输得真好看~ 下次模拟也要来找Aschan认输噢": "What a lovely loss~ Come surrender to Aschan in the next mock battle too",
  // 台词 · 全部通过
  "四组全部撑过来了，恭喜噢~": "You made it through all four sets. Congrats~",
  "居然真的通过了，稍微有点意外呢": "You actually cleared it. That's a bit of a surprise",
  // 台词 · 讨伐成功
  "呜哇——被打倒了~（棒读）": "Waaah, I'm defeated~ (flatly)",
  "恭喜完成初次任务，报酬去找酒场的店主领噢": "Congrats on your First Quest. Collect your reward from the tavern keeper",
  // 台词 · 无尽战斗
  "欢迎来到永远不会结束的模拟战~": "Welcome to the mock battle that never ends~",
  "在这里输多少次都没关系噢♥": "You can lose here as many times as you like♥",
  "冒险者的梦想？已经不需要了吧": "An adventurer's dream? You don't need that anymore",
  "手停不下来了呢，真是个乖孩子": "Your hand won't stop. Such a good boy",
  "就这样一直待在酒场的里间吧": "Just stay in the tavern's back room forever",
  "认输的按钮就在那里哟~": "The surrender button is right there~",
  // 台词 · 无尽-放弃
  "之后可不要再重蹈覆辙了噢♥": "Don't make the same mistake again♥",
  "明天也来模拟败北吧~": "Come back for another mock defeat tomorrow~",
  // 台词 · 无尽-败北
  "无尽战斗里也失手了呢♥": "Slipped up even in the Endless Battle♥",
  "再来一次吧~": "Let's go again~",
  // 台词 · 倒计时
  "还剩{n}秒噢~": "{n} sec left~",
  "{n}，快撑不住了吧？": "{n}. You can't take it, can you?",
  // 台词 · 特写-胸
  "往这里看~": "Look here~",
  "心跳听到了吗♥": "Hear my heartbeat?♥",
  "想埋进来吗？": "Want to bury your face?",
  // 台词 · 特写-臀
  "视线跟过来了呢~": "Your eyes followed~",
  "喜欢这边吗？": "Like this side?",
  "晃一下给你看♥": "I'll give it a shake♥",
  // 台词 · 特写-眼
  "看着Aschan的眼睛": "Look into Aschan's eyes",
  "不许移开视线♥": "Don't look away♥",
  "已经被迷住了吧？": "Already under my spell?",
  // 台词 · 集中线
  "认输吧♥": "Surrender♥",
  "败北吧！": "Lose!",
  "投降！": "Give up!",
  // 台词 · 命令
  "握紧一点～": "Grip it tighter~",
  "深呼吸～": "Deep breath~",
  "放松，轻轻握住": "Relax, hold it gently",
  "只照顾前端～": "Just the tip~",
  "好好看着Aschan～": "Eyes on Aschan~",
  "握紧！不准松": "Grip it! Don't let go",
  "换另一只手♥": "Switch hands♥",
  "不准停下～": "Don't you dare stop~",
  // 台词 · 奖励
  "乖孩子，奖励你♥": "Good boy, here's your reward♥",
  "做得好～ 啾♥": "Well done~ Chu♥",
  "听话的奖励哦♥": "A reward for obeying♥",
  // 台词 · 遵命-结算-零
  "Aschan的命令，一次都没有服从呢——嘴硬的勇者，Aschan也不讨厌哦♥": "Not one order obeyed—stubborn hero. Aschan doesn't mind♥",
  // 台词 · 遵命-结算-少
  "Aschan的命令，一共服从了『{n}』次呢——还差得远哦，下次要更听话♥": "You obeyed Aschan {n} times—a long way to go. Be better next time♥",
  // 台词 · 遵命-结算-多
  "Aschan的命令，一共服从了『{n}』次呢——很有前途嘛，乖孩子♥": "You obeyed Aschan {n} times—you show promise, good boy♥",
  // 台词 · 遵命-结算-全
  "Aschan的命令，全部服从了『{n}』次呢——已经是Aschan的东西了♥": "You obeyed all {n} of Aschan's orders—you belong to Aschan now♥",

  // ================= 委托 002 =================
  // 委托单、提示条、定时演出（quest-002.jsonc）
  "城门卫兵团": "City Gate Guard",
  "円 藏纱": "Kurasha",
  "握力器": "Hand grip",
  "按照节奏挥舞『圣剑』，并且抓住机会进行攻击吧": "Swing your 『Holy Sword』 to the rhythm and strike when you get the chance",
  "如果在限定时间内没能完成动作，就会导致讨伐失败": "Fail to act within the time limit and the quest fails",
  "除了『点击』之外，可能还需要更多不同的操作方式": "Besides 『tapping』, you may need other kinds of moves",
  "努力集中注意力，千万不要错过任何一次机会噢": "Stay focused and don't miss a single chance",
  // 剧情（story-002.jsonc）
  "根据任务书的指引，你一路找到了城外的小木屋": "Following the quest sheet, you track her down to a small cabin outside the city.",
  "异世界的访客吗……还是第一次接触呢。不过【公会破坏者】什么的，还真是危险的名字呢……": "A visitor from another world… First time I've met one. Still, \"Guild Crusher\"… what a dangerous name…",
  "噗w 什么【公会破坏者】啦~ 人家的称号，明明是【社团破坏者】才对": "Pfft lol, \"Guild Crusher\"~? My title is \"Circle Crusher,\" duh",
  "不过这也算是异世界转生之后的改版？破坏ギルド的ギャル，也还挺有趣的嘛w 噗哈哈哈~": "Then again, maybe getting isekai'd gave me an upgrade? A gal who crushes guilds… kinda fun lol. Pfft, hahaha~",
  "多说无益，拔剑吧！": "Enough talk. Draw your sword!",
  "哎呀…但是人家并不擅长战斗嘛~": "Aww… but I'm not good at fighting~",
  "比起这些……": "More importantly…",
  "就不能悄悄地放了人家么？帅气的大哥哥~": "Can't you just quietly let me go? Handsome big bro~",
  "只要哥哥瞒着公会，悄悄地放过人家…人家一定会好好「报答」的♥": "If you keep it from the Guild and let me slip away… I'll make sure to \"repay\" you♥",
  "——要怎么做？": "What will you do?",
  "悄悄放过她": "Quietly let her go",
  "诶？真的要放过人家吗~？哥哥好温柔♥": "Huh? You're really letting me go~? You're so sweet♥",
  "那就说好了哦。回到公会，就说「没找到人」~": "Then it's a deal. Back at the Guild, you say you \"couldn't find her\"~",
  "……只是这一次而已。": "…Just this once.",
  "嘻嘻，从现在开始，哥哥就是人家的共犯咯w": "Hehe, from now on you're my accomplice lol",
  "那么~约好的「报答」，现在就开始吧。要一直、一直收下去哦♥": "Now then~ let's start that \"repayment\" I promised. You'll keep receiving it forever and ever♥",
  "面对战斗的外行人，你顺利地击倒了公会破坏者": "Against a complete amateur at combat, you easily take down the Guild Crusher.",
  "好过分~ 居然对女孩子这么粗鲁~": "So mean~ Being that rough with a girl~",
  "乖乖投降，不要再反抗了": "Surrender quietly. Stop resisting.",
  "人家知道啦……": "Okay, okay…",
  "不过比起回去~ 人家更想加入哥哥所在的公会呢♥": "But you know~ rather than going back, I'd like to join your Guild♥",
  "之后说不定，就可以成为哥哥的队友，跟您一起冒险了呀~": "Then maybe I could join your party and go adventuring with you~",
  "唔，这个嘛……": "Hmm, well…",
  "诶嘿~就知道哥哥会站在人家这边♥": "Ehehe~ I knew you'd be on my side♥",
  "推荐信上要写「这孩子绝对没问题」哦~担保人的名字，也要签得大大的": "In the recommendation letter, write \"She's absolutely trustworthy\"~ And sign your name as guarantor nice and big",
  "……是。": "…Yes.",
  "谢谢哥哥~ 这样一来，人家就也可以加入公会啦w 以后可以两个人一起，偷偷地做各种各样见不得人的事情了呢。": "Thanks, big bro~ Now I can join the Guild too lol. From now on, the two of us can secretly do all sorts of things nobody can know about.",
  "作为谢礼，人家现在就给哥哥「奖励」~": "As thanks, I'll give you a \"reward\" right now~",
  "以后，还会有更多更多，需要哥哥背着公会帮人家忙的事情唷♥": "And there'll be lots and lots more things I need your help with behind the Guild's back♥",
  "还要继续讨伐人家吗~？": "Still want to subjugate me~?",
  "可以请哥哥帮人家写推荐信，顺便当人家的担保人吗~？": "Could you write me a recommendation letter, and be my guarantor while you're at it~?",
  "正常地向公会报告": "Report to the Guild as usual",
  "帮忙写信大力推荐": "Write her a glowing recommendation",
  // 台词 · 委托开场
  "讨伐对象：异世界漂泊者【公会破坏者】。推测战斗能力低下。": "Target: otherworldly drifter [Guild Crusher]. Combat ability presumed low.",
  "注意：该个体擅长言语诱导。任务期间请勿与其进行任何交易。": "Caution: this individual is skilled at verbal manipulation. Make no deals with her during the quest.",
  "发现可以攻击的机会，不要错过。当机立断的出手，否则会反过来输掉。": "When you see an opening, don't miss it. Strike without hesitation, or you'll be the one who loses.",
  // 台词 · 言责-背叛
  "背叛吧~": "Betray them~",
  "背叛公会就给你奖励噢": "Betray the Guild and I'll reward you",
  "回去就说「没找到人」不就好了w": "Just tell them you \"couldn't find her\" lol",
  "任务书又不会开口说话": "The quest sheet can't talk",
  "不会有人知道的": "Nobody will ever know",
  "是我们两个人的秘密~": "Our little secret~",
  "帮人家隐瞒下来": "Keep me hidden",
  "人家会报答哥哥的~": "I'll repay you, big bro~",
  "公会的人好烦~~": "The Guild people are so annoying~~",
  "背叛♥ 背叛♥ 背叛♥": "Betray♥ Betray♥ Betray♥",
  "比起报酬，人家的奖励肯定更好~": "My reward beats any bounty~",
  "帮人家捏造报告书吧": "Help me fake the report",
  "背叛伙伴是很舒服的": "Betraying your friends feels so good",
  "为了敌人去欺骗自己的同伴~": "Deceiving your own friends for the enemy~",
  "为了帮人家去说谎吧w": "Lie for me lol",
  "哥哥是人家的共犯~": "You're my accomplice, big bro~",
  "你不说，人家也不说，谁会知道": "You won't tell, I won't tell. Who'd ever know?",
  "冒险什么的才不重要": "Adventuring doesn't even matter",
  "来做个交易吧~": "Let's make a deal~",
  "让人家教哥哥，背叛的快感": "Let me teach you the thrill of betrayal",
  "讨伐费有多少？人家用身体补差价哦": "How much is the bounty? I'll pay the difference with my body",
  "是两个人的小秘密": "Just a little secret between us",
  "为人家当叛徒吧~": "Turn traitor for me~",
  "公会里的人都好烦，只有哥哥最好": "Everyone at the Guild is annoying. You're the only good one",
  "只有哥哥是站在人家这边的~": "You're the only one on my side~",
  "人家只能依靠哥哥了~": "You're all I have to rely on~",
  "哥哥是最帅气的": "You're the coolest, big bro",
  "就为了人家放水一次，好不好~？": "Go easy on me just this once, okay~?",
  "来嘛，当一次坏冒险者": "Come on, be a bad adventurer just once",
  "背叛的时候，优越感很爽吧": "Feeling superior while you betray them is the best, right?",
  "为了坏女人，要对不起伙伴了哟~": "Letting your friends down for a bad girl~",
  "背叛只要一次，后面都是余韵": "You only betray once. The rest is afterglow",
  "帮人家破坏你的公会关系吧，哥哥": "Wreck your ties with the Guild for me, big bro",
  "伙伴那边，就说是魔物太狡猾了嘛~": "Just tell your friends the monster was too sly~",
  "报告书上少写一行，又不会怎样w": "Leave one line off the report. No big deal lol",
  "公会的规矩？人家帮哥哥忘掉~": "Guild rules? I'll help you forget them~",
  "说谎的时候心跳会变快哦，好刺激吧？": "Your heart races when you lie, right? Thrilling, huh?",
  "伙伴越信任你，背叛起来越舒服哦w": "The more your friends trust you, the better betrayal feels lol",
  "人家的奖励，公会可给不了~": "The Guild can't give you my kind of reward~",
  "悄悄的，不要让任何人发现哦~": "Quietly now, don't let anyone find out~",
  "哥哥也想试试当一次坏人吧？": "You want to try being the bad guy once too, right?",
  "放过人家，就当作两个人的约定~": "Let me go, and it'll be our promise~",
  "只要今天一次，哥哥就是人家的人了♥": "Just today, just once, and you're mine♥",
  // 台词 · 心声-背叛
  "只要不说出去…": "If I just don't tell…",
  "报告书…怎么写": "The report… what do I write",
  "就一次…的话": "Just once… maybe",
  "伙伴们会知道吗": "Would my friends find out",
  "她好像很可怜": "She looks so pitiful",
  "不能被她骗": "I can't let her fool me",
  "报酬…还重要吗": "Does the reward… even matter",
  "这算背叛吗": "Is this betrayal?",
  "好想答应她": "I want to say yes",
  "背叛一定很舒服的…": "Betraying would feel so good…",
  // 台词 · 准备-第1组
  "真的拔剑了呀~ 那人家可要好好看着哥哥咯": "You really drew your sword~ Then I'll be watching you nice and close",
  "哥哥的『圣剑』，要好好对准人家噢~": "Aim that \"Holy Sword\" right at me, big bro~",
  // 台词 · 准备-第2组
  "站着好累~人家要坐下来看哥哥努力w": "Standing is tiring~ I'll sit and watch you work hard lol",
  "哥哥的视线，到底在看哪里呢~": "Where exactly are your eyes looking~?",
  // 台词 · 准备-第3组
  "休息够了~人家要认真一点点了噢": "Break's over~ I'm getting a little bit serious now",
  "刚才那种程度，哥哥还游刃有余嘛？": "Was that last round still easy for you?",
  // 台词 · 准备-第4组
  "最后了哦~ 哥哥就为了人家，输这一次好不好嘛♥": "This is the last one~ Lose just this once, for me, pretty please♥",
  "再撑下去，可就真的要把人家送走了哟~~": "Keep holding out and you'll really be sending me away~~",
  // 台词 · 准备
  "准备好了吗，哥哥~？": "Ready, big bro~?",
  "深呼吸~然后继续加油吧w": "Deep breath~ now keep it up lol",
  // 台词 · 第1组-前段
  "人家是真的不会打架嘛~ 只好这样一直看着哥哥了": "I really can't fight~ So all I can do is keep watching you like this",
  "哥哥的手，动得好认真呢~": "Your hand is moving so seriously~",
  "不用那么紧张嘛~ 这里只有人家和哥哥两个人哦": "No need to be so tense~ It's just the two of us here",
  // 台词 · 第1组-中段
  "哎呀~人家刚刚是不是露出破绽了？": "Oops~ did I just leave an opening?",
  "一边挥剑一边盯着人家，好忙哦w": "Swinging your sword and staring at me, so busy lol",
  "公会给了哥哥多少钱呀？人家能给的，可比那个好多了~": "How much is the Guild paying you? What I can give you is so much better~",
  // 台词 · 第1组-后段
  "把人家赶回去，哥哥又能得到什么呢~？": "Send me away, and what do you actually get out of it~?",
  "再怎么拼命，公会也不会多看哥哥一眼的呀~": "No matter how hard you try, the Guild won't spare you a second glance~",
  // 台词 · 第2组-前段
  "从这个角度看，哥哥忍着的表情一清二楚呢w": "From down here I can see every bit of you trying to hold it in lol",
  "腿好看吗？不写进报告书的话，随便哥哥看哦~": "Like my legs? Leave it out of the report and you can look all you want~",
  // 台词 · 第2组-中段
  "视线又往下跑了哦~ 这也算是在调查人家吗w": "Your eyes are drifting down again~ Is that \"investigating\" me too? lol",
  "偷偷看人家的腿，要跟伙伴保密哦~": "Sneaking looks at my legs~ Keep that from your party",
  "人家浑身都是破绽哦~ 哥哥最想碰哪一个呢？": "I'm full of openings~ Which one do you want to touch the most?",
  // 台词 · 第2组-后段
  "呼吸都乱掉了呢w 还说是来讨伐人家的~": "Your breathing's all over the place lol. And you came here to subjugate me~",
  "踩在哥哥脸上，哥哥说「没找到人」就不算撒谎啦~": "If I'm standing on your face, saying you \"couldn't find her\" isn't even a lie~",
  // 台词 · 第3组-前段
  "还没看够呀？没关系哦，人家不讨厌被哥哥盯着~": "Still haven't seen enough? That's okay, I don't mind you staring~",
  "这一回久一点哦~ 人家想多看看哥哥忍耐的样子w": "This one's a little longer~ I want to watch you hold it in some more lol",
  // 台词 · 第3组-中段
  "公会里那些人，有谁像这样认真看过哥哥吗？": "Has anyone at the Guild ever really looked at you the way I am now?",
  "就这一次嘛~ 只要一次，站到人家这边来": "Just this once~ Just one time, come over to my side",
  "手指可别松开哦，会被人家溜掉的~": "Don't let go with your finger, or I'll slip away~",
  // 台词 · 第3组-后段
  "在人家这里，哥哥早就是最高等级了哟~": "As far as I'm concerned, you've been top rank for ages~",
  "差一点点就能当人家的共犯了♥": "You're this close to being my accomplice♥",
  // 台词 · 第4组-前段
  "现在改主意也还来得及哦~ 人家一个字都不会说的": "It's not too late to change your mind~ I won't breathe a word of it",
  "报告书要怎么写，人家都帮哥哥想好了w": "I've already worked out what you'll write in the report lol",
  "哥哥只要点一下头，人家今晚就不用被赶走了呢~": "All you have to do is nod, and I won't have to be sent away tonight~",
  // 台词 · 第4组-中段
  "认输的那条路，人家一直给哥哥留着哦~": "I've been keeping the way to surrender open for you this whole time~",
  "背叛自慰的时候，人家会一直温柔地陪着哥哥♥": "While you jerk off to betrayal, I'll stay right by your side, so gently♥",
  "伙伴呀、冒险呀，哪一样比得上现在舒服呢~": "Friends, adventure… does any of it feel as good as this does right now~",
  // 台词 · 第4组-后段
  "已经撑不住了吧w 把剑放下来嘛，哥哥~": "You can't hold out anymore, can you lol. Just put the sword down~",
  "说一声「我输了」，人家就让哥哥升天哦♥": "Just say \"I lose\" and I'll send you straight to heaven♥",
  // 台词 · 前段
  "人家不会打架的嘛~": "I can't fight~",
  "哥哥好凶~": "You're so scary~",
  // 台词 · 中段
  "放水一次，好不好~？": "Go easy just once, okay~?",
  // 台词 · 后段
  "背叛吧，哥哥~": "Betray them, big bro~",
  "不会有人知道的哦w": "Nobody will know lol",
  // 台词 · cutin-前到中
  "哥哥，再快一点♥": "Faster, come on♥",
  "跟得上人家吗？": "Can you keep up with me?",
  "别慢下来嘛~": "Don't slow down~",
  // 台词 · cutin-中到后
  "背叛吧~♥": "Betray them~♥",
  "就差一点了哟~": "Just a little more~",
  "要撑不住了吧w": "Can't hold on, can you lol",
  // 台词 · 长按中
  "对嘛~ 就这样，不要松开♥": "That's it~ just like that, don't let go♥",
  "放弃也是一种背叛哦w": "Giving up is a kind of betrayal too lol",
  "再一下下，就是两个人的秘密了~": "Just a little more and it's our secret~",
  // 台词 · 松手
  "欸~差一点点就好了嘛": "Aww~ you were so close",
  "犹豫的样子好可爱w": "You're cute when you hesitate lol",
  "下一次，可别再缩回去了哦~♥": "Next time, no pulling back~♥",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-点击
  "哎呀~人家好像不太会打架呢": "Oops~ guess I'm not much of a fighter",
  "欸？刚才是不是被看穿了什么~": "Huh? Did you just see through something~?",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-按住
  "想抓住人家的话，可要握紧一点噢~": "If you want to catch me, grip tighter~",
  "抓到了的话，就别急着放开嘛~": "If you've caught me, don't be in such a rush to let go~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-拖动
  "想追上人家？那就跟紧一点哦~": "Want to catch up to me? Then stay close~",
  "人家要溜走了哦~ 哥哥舍得吗？": "I'm slipping away~ Can you really bear to let me?",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-点击+点击
  "哥哥的手，忙得过来吗w": "Can your hands keep up lol",
  "两边都要顾好哦~": "Watch both sides~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-点击+按住
  "一只手可不够用哦~": "One hand won't be enough~",
  "这边也要、那边也要，好贪心w": "This one and that one too? So greedy lol",
  // 台词 · 挑战-引诱放弃
  "来嘛~ 手往那边伸就好了♥": "Come on~ just reach over there♥",
  "比起人家的破绽，哥哥更想碰的是那边吧w": "You'd rather touch that than my openings, wouldn't you lol",
  // 台词 · 挑战-命中
  "欸~被发现了？": "Aww~ you found it?",
  "呀~ 哥哥下手好重": "Eek~ so rough",
  "唔…手好快": "Ugh… fast hands",
  "讨厌~ 偏偏碰那里": "Hey~ of all the places to touch",
  "下次可不会让哥哥得逞了哟": "I won't let you get away with that next time",
  "好痛~ 哥哥要负责的哦？": "Ow~ you'll take responsibility, right?",
  // 台词 · 暂停-第1组后
  "呼~哥哥好凶。不过人家看到了噢，哥哥刚才犹豫了一下下w": "Phew~ you're scary. But I saw it: you hesitated for a second just now lol",
  "好痛哦~ ……要赔礼的话，下一回就对人家手下留情，好不好~？": "That hurt~… If you want to make it up to me, go easy on me next round, okay~?",
  // 台词 · 暂停-第2组后
  "哥哥好认真、好帅~ 这么帅气的侧脸，公会的人一定没看过吧？": "You're so serious, so cool~ I bet no one at the Guild has seen that handsome profile, right?",
  "明明看见破绽了，却故意忍到最后一刻……那种刺激，哥哥也喜欢吧~♥": "Seeing the opening and holding off until the very last second… you like that thrill too, don't you~♥",
  // 台词 · 暂停-第3组后
  "只剩最后一回了呢……哥哥真的舍得把人家交出去吗？人家会哭的哟~~": "Only one round left… Can you really bring yourself to hand me over? I'll cry~~",
  "已经快要坚持不住了吧w 现在收手，下次再努力也还是可以的~~": "You're about to crack, aren't you lol. You can quit now and try again next time~~",
  // 台词 · 暂停
  "休息一下吧~哥哥累了吧？": "Take a break~ You must be tired, big bro?",
  "还要继续吗？人家可以等哥哥想清楚噢~": "Still going? I can wait till you make up your mind~",
  // 台词 · 放弃-前段
  "这么快就投降了呀？哥哥真好说话w": "Surrendering already? You're such a pushover lol",
  "才刚开始就为人家放水了呢~": "Barely started and you're already going easy on me~",
  // 台词 · 放弃-中段
  "公会的委托，就这样搞砸啦~": "And just like that, the Guild's quest is ruined~",
  "人家就说嘛，哥哥是站在人家这边的♥": "See? I told you you're on my side♥",
  // 台词 · 放弃-后段
  "就差一点点……为了人家，真是辛苦哥哥了w": "So close… Thanks for all your hard work, for my sake lol",
  "最后还是选了人家呢~报告书要记得写好哦": "In the end you chose me~ Don't forget to write that report nicely",
  // 台词 · 撤退
  "认输了呀？那报告书上，就写「没找到人」咯~": "Giving up? Then the report will just say \"couldn't find her\"~",
  "回去跟公会说什么，都随哥哥喜欢哦w": "Tell the Guild whatever you like lol",
  // 台词 · 败北
  "抓不住人家呢~这下是哥哥输了w": "Couldn't catch me~ You lose lol",
  "看来是人家赢了噢~报告书就写「没找到人」吧": "Looks like I win~ Write \"couldn't find her\" in the report",
  // 台词 · 败北-点击
  "破绽都送到眼前了，哥哥却舍不得碰呀w": "The opening was right in front of you, and you couldn't bear to touch it lol",
  "慢了一步哦~人家已经逃开啦": "One step too slow~ I already got away",
  // 台词 · 败北-按住
  "手一松，人家就溜走了哟~": "Loosen your grip and I slip away~",
  "握不住的话，就只能让人家赢咯♥": "If you can't hold on, I win♥",
  // 台词 · 败北-拖动
  "追到一半就放弃了？好可惜w": "Gave up halfway through the chase? Too bad lol",
  "差一点就抓住了呢~下次再来吧": "You almost caught me~ Try again next time",
  // 台词 · 处决-前言
  "输给人家了呢~ 那就不用再演了嘛♥": "You lost to me~ So I can drop the act now♥",
  "最后数10秒哦~ 数到0，哥哥就彻底是人家的共犯了": "I'll count the last 10 seconds~ At 0, you're my accomplice for good",
  "公会的事全部忘掉，好好听人家数吧w": "Forget all about the Guild and listen to me count lol",
  // 台词 · 处决-cutin
  // 台词 · 处决-倒数
  "{n}，回不去咯w": "{n}, no going back lol",
  "还剩{n}哦~哥哥": "{n} left~ big bro",
  "{n}……公会在看哦": "{n}… the Guild is watching",
  // 台词 · 处决-心声
  "公会的委托……": "The Guild's quest…",
  "回不去了……": "There's no going back…",
  "不能……背叛……": "I can't… betray them…",
  // 台词 · 处决-归零
  "背叛成立♥": "Betrayal complete♥",
  "共犯成立♥": "Accomplice sealed♥",
  // 台词 · 处决-结算
  "报告书就写「没找到人」吧♥ 这下彻底回不去咯~": "Write \"couldn't find her\" in the report♥ Now there's truly no going back~",
  "哥哥输掉的样子，人家会一直记得哦w": "I'll always remember the way you lost lol",
  // 台词 · 全部通过
  "呜……居然全都撑过来了？哥哥好顽固~": "Ugh… you actually made it through all of it? You're so stubborn~",
  "居然一次都没有上钩……好过分~": "Not falling for it even once… so mean~",
  // 台词 · 讨伐成功
  "真的照实报告上去了呀……哥哥好无情~": "You really reported it all, just like that… so heartless~",
  "好吧~人家回去就是了。哥哥可不要想人家哦w": "Fine~ I'll go back. Don't go missing me, okay lol",
  // 台词 · 无尽战斗
  "这就是背叛的奖励哦~还满意吗？": "This is betrayal's reward~ Satisfied?",
  "公会那边，人家会帮哥哥瞒着的♥": "I'll keep it all hidden from the Guild for you♥",
  "哥哥已经是人家的共犯咯w": "You're already my accomplice lol",
  "伙伴们在找你呢~要回去吗？": "Your friends are looking for you~ Going back?",
  "一直留在这里，就不会被发现了哦": "Stay here forever and no one will find you",
  "说好的「报答」，要一直收下去哦~": "The \"repayment\" I promised, you'll keep receiving it~",
  "背叛的余韵，好好享受吧♥": "Savor the afterglow of betrayal♥",
  "冒险什么的，已经不重要了吧？": "Adventuring doesn't matter anymore, right?",
  "两个人的秘密，要一直守住哦~": "Let's keep our secret forever~",
  "哥哥的名字，已经从名册上消失咯w": "Your name's already gone from the roster lol",
  "再多背叛一点点嘛~": "Betray them just a little more~",
  "人家的报答，还没结束哟♥": "My repayment isn't over yet♥",
  // 台词 · 无尽-放弃
  "下次也要偷偷来找人家哦~♥": "Come see me in secret next time too~♥",
  "报告书上的谎，要圆好噢w": "Keep your story straight on that report lol",
  "这下彻底回不去了呢~": "Now there's really no going back~",
  // 台词 · 无尽-败北
  "抓不住人家的哥哥，最可爱了♥": "You're cutest when you can't catch me♥",
  "又输给人家咯~明天也来吧w": "Lost to me again~ Come back tomorrow lol",
  // 台词 · 倒计时
  "{n}~": "{n}~",
  "还有{n}秒哦~": "{n} sec left~",
  "{n}……要放水了吗？": "{n}… going easy on me?",
  "只剩{n}秒咯♥": "Only {n} sec left♥",
  // 台词 · 特写-胸
  "人家的报酬~": "My reward~",
  "比讨伐费好吧？": "Better than a bounty, right?",
  "想要吗~？": "Want it~?",
  "偷看要保密哦": "Keep your peeking secret",
  // 台词 · 特写-臀
  "会好好报答的♥": "I'll repay you properly♥",
  "要跟过来吗？": "Coming after me?",
  "别告诉伙伴哦": "Don't tell your party",
  "这边也不错吧w": "Not bad back here, huh lol",
  // 台词 · 特写-眼
  "只看着人家~": "Look only at me~",
  "背叛吧♥": "Betray them♥",
  "哥哥是共犯哦": "You're my accomplice",
  "人家只信你~": "You're the only one I trust~",
  // 台词 · 特写-腿
  "晃呀晃~": "Swing, swing~",
  "盯着看了吧w": "You were staring lol",
  "想要被踩哪里呢~？": "Where do you want to be stepped on~?",
  // 台词 · 集中线
  "背叛吧~！": "Betray them~!",
  "主动认输~": "Surrender yourself~",
  "两个人的秘密♥": "Our secret♥",
  "当人家的共犯~": "Be my accomplice~",
  // 台词 · 命令
  "小声一点～ 别被发现♥": "Keep it quiet~ Don't get caught♥",
  "握紧哦，哥哥～": "Grip it tight, big bro~",
  "眼睛只准看人家～": "Eyes only on me~",
  "深呼吸，别出声～": "Deep breath, not a sound~",
  "换只手，别停下～": "Switch hands, don't stop~",
  "握紧！共犯的约定♥": "Grip it! Accomplices' promise♥",
  // 台词 · 奖励
  "共犯的奖励♥": "An accomplice's reward♥",
  "哥哥好乖～ 啾♥": "Good boy, big bro~ Chu♥",
  "这是封口费哦♥": "This is hush money♥",
  // 台词 · 处决-命令
  "哥哥，握紧～": "Grip it, big bro~",
  // 台词 · 处决-命令-最后
  "不准停哦♥": "No stopping♥",

  // ================= 委托 003 =================
  // 委托单、提示条、定时演出（quest-003.jsonc）
  "中央正教会": "Central Orthodox Church",
  "爱莉儿": "Ariel",
  "今天的晚祷只有一段哦~ 60秒，陪我数完就好": "Tonight's prayer is just one part~ 60 seconds, just count it through with me",
  "等我数到0，就算你赢了~ 很简单吧♥": "Once I count to 0, you win~ Simple, isn't it♥",
  "好孩子♥": "Good boy♥",
  "嗯~？数字怎么不动了呢~": "Hmm~? Why did the numbers stop~",
  "嘘——": "Shh…",
  "0……是秘密哦♥": "0… is a secret♥",
  "再陪我一会儿吧~ 数字要涨回去咯♥": "Stay with me a bit longer~ The numbers are going back up♥",
  "这次的任务只有这一组，加油撑过去就赢咯~": "This quest is just this one set. Hang on and you win~",
  "0.9~ 没有停在1哦，好好在数呢♥": "0.9~ Didn't stop at 1. I'm counting properly♥",
  "0.5……还剩一半~": "0.5… halfway there~",
  "0.1……接下来就是——": "0.1… and next is…",
  "0.09♥ 小数点后面，还有好多好多哦~": "0.09♥ There are so many, many more after the decimal point~",
  "还在忍耐吗？还没到0哦~": "Still enduring? It's not 0 yet~",
  "啾♥": "Chu♥",
  "0.01……骗你的~♥": "0.01… just kidding~♥",
  "发现了吗~？0一直含在我嘴里哦。我不念出来，你就永远赢不了呢♥": "Noticed~? The 0's been on my tongue all along. Until I say it, you can't win♥",
  "想要0的话，放弃就好了呀~ 你看，它就挂在那里呢♥": "If you want the 0, just give up~ Look, it's hanging right there♥",
  "接好♥": "Catch♥",
  "不要吗？那就……越数越多了哟~": "You don't want it? Then… the count just keeps going up~",
  "10……还在涨哦♥": "10… still rising♥",
  "20~ 『圣剑』还握得住吗？": "20~ Can you still grip your \"Holy Sword\"?",
  "快到30了呢~ 然后呢，再从30开始数哦♥": "Almost 30~ And then I'll start counting again from 30♥",
  "这么想让我数下去的话，就好好开口乞求我吧~": "If you want me to keep counting that badly, beg me properly~",
  "好好说出来，想要我数到哪个数字呢~？": "Say it clearly. Which number do you want me to count to~?",
  "声音太小了，听不见呢~": "Too quiet, I can't hear you~",
  "大声一点，要拼命地拜托我喔~": "Louder. Beg me with everything you've got~",
  "还是听不太清楚呢~": "I still can't quite hear you~",
  "再大声一点，把0描得满满的吧♥": "Louder still. Trace that 0 all the way♥",
  "有好好听话呢~ 作为奖励，这次就数到最后吧♥": "You did as you were told~ As a reward, this time I'll count to the end♥",
  "这是最后一次了……这次是真的哦~": "This is the last time… for real this time~",
  "最后……♥": "Last…♥",
  // 剧情（story-003.jsonc）
  "外城区的小教会只点着几根蜡烛。粉色长发的修女从告解室后走出来，朝你微微颔首": "Only a few candles light the little church in the outer district. A nun with long pink hair steps out from behind the confessional and gives you a small nod.",
  "欢迎。是来做晚祷的吗？还是……来核实什么可笑的举报？": "Welcome. Here for evening prayers? Or… to check on some ridiculous report?",
  "公会确实接到了匿名举报。说这里的修女，是魅魔假扮的……": "The Guild did receive an anonymous tip. It says the nun here is a succubus in disguise…",
  "我本来没有相信的，但是……你的那个角……？": "I didn't believe it at first, but… those horns…?",
  "嘻嘻~♥ 告解的时候，视线明明可以再低一点的嘛。这样的话，就不用发现不该看到的东西了~": "Hehe~♥ During confession, you could keep your eyes a little lower. Then you wouldn't notice things you shouldn't see~",
  "所以，你真的是魅魔！？": "So you really are a succubus!?",
  "没关系，等结束之后~ 你会忘记这一切的♥": "It's all right. Once it's over~ you'll forget all of this♥",
  "进来好好忏悔吧~♥": "Come in and repent properly~♥",
  "伴随着教堂里的钟声，最后一个数字终于落下": "With the toll of the church bell, the last number finally falls.",
  "哈啊……哈啊……终于，我坚持下来了": "Hah… hah… Finally, I made it through.",
  "呵呵~ 明明是靠可怜兮兮地乞求我，才换来的最后一个数字吧~？": "Hehe~ you only got that last number by pitifully begging me for it, didn't you~?",
  "比起获胜~ 其实你的下面早就忍不住想要输掉了才对": "Rather than winning~ the truth is, down there you've been dying to lose for ages",
  "果然呢~ 你一进门的时候，我就知道你是很有潜力的信徒了": "Just as I thought~ The moment you walked in, I knew you had real potential as a believer",
  "那么就请在这里，享用无尽的忏悔与祷告吧~♥": "Then please, stay here and enjoy endless repentance and prayer~♥",
  "你想要的，到底是什么呢~？": "What is it you really want~?",
  "坦诚自己的欲望": "Confess your desire",
  // 台词 · 委托开场
  "欢迎来到小教会。是要告解，还是捐款呢？": "Welcome to our little church. Here for confession, or a donation?",
  "举报我是魅魔？那就请你亲自确认♥": "Someone reported me as a succubus? Then please, see for yourself♥",
  "别紧张，我只是个很温柔的修女哦~": "Relax. I'm just a very gentle nun~",
  // 台词 · 准备
  "双手合十……不对，握住『圣剑』吧": "Put your hands together… no, grip your \"Holy Sword\"",
  "跟着我的节奏，像祷告一样~": "Follow my rhythm, like a prayer~",
  "准备好了吗，我的新信徒？": "Ready, my new faithful?",
  "数字由我来念，你只要忍耐": "I'll call out the numbers. You just endure",
  // 台词 · 前段
  "今天的祷告，从握住『圣剑』开始哦": "Today's prayer begins with gripping your \"Holy Sword\"",
  "别那么紧张，我又不会吃了你~": "Don't be so tense. I won't eat you~",
  "信徒增加，是因为我很温柔吧？": "My flock is growing because I'm so gentle, don't you think?",
  "数字还早呢。再靠近一点听听？": "The numbers are still far off. Want to come closer and listen?",
  "你的视线，比祷告词更诚实哦": "Your eyes are more honest than your prayers",
  "告解不用跪着。站着忍也可以~": "No need to kneel for confession. You can endure standing up~",
  "据说这里几十年没出现过魅魔了": "They say no succubus has appeared here in decades",
  "温柔的修女，看起来像魅魔吗？": "Does a gentle nun look like a succubus to you?",
  // 台词 · 中段
  "呼吸乱了呢。还在假装镇定吗？": "Your breathing's a mess. Still pretending to be calm?",
  "『圣剑』握得这么紧，是在祈祷？": "Gripping your \"Holy Sword\" so tight… are you praying?",
  "坦白吧，已经有点想认输了吧": "Confess. You already kind of want to give up, don't you?",
  "好孩子不用硬撑。输了也有赦免": "Good boys don't need to push so hard. Even losing comes with absolution",
  "数字是我在念的，急也没用哦": "I'm the one calling the numbers. Rushing won't help",
  "再坚持下去，也只是多受一点苦": "Holding on longer just means suffering a little more",
  "看你这样子，已经在告解了吧？": "Looking like that, you're practically confessing already",
  "明明是你自己先沉下去的呢~": "You're the one who started sinking first, you know~",
  "想听我数到尽头？那可得求我": "Want me to count all the way? Then you'll have to beg",
  "放弃的话，我会温柔地接住你♥": "If you give up, I'll catch you so gently♥",
  // 台词 · 后段
  "够了吧。把『圣剑』放下，好不好": "That's enough. Put down your \"Holy Sword\", won't you?",
  "认输不是堕落，是一种赦免哦": "Surrender isn't a fall from grace. It's absolution",
  "数字还在走，你已经走不动了": "The numbers keep going, but you can't anymore",
  "想解脱的话，认输是最快的路": "If you want release, surrender is the quickest path",
  "好孩子，不用再当勇者了~": "Good boy, you don't have to be a hero anymore~",
  "再忍下去，也只是让我更开心": "Enduring any longer only makes me happier",
  "来，把败北交给我。我会数完的": "Come, hand your defeat to me. I'll count it through",
  "祷告结束了哦。你可以输了♥": "Prayer's over. You're allowed to lose now♥",
  // 台词 · cutin-前到中
  "祷告要加快了哦": "The prayer quickens",
  "还在忍耐吗？": "Still enduring?",
  "告解才刚开始": "Confession has only begun",
  "心跳漏拍了呢": "Your heart skipped a beat",
  // 台词 · cutin-中到后
  "已经不行了吧": "You're done for, aren't you",
  "数字我说了算": "I decide the numbers",
  "快到尽头了呢": "Almost at the end",
  "认输也没关系": "It's fine to surrender",
  // 台词 · 长按中
  "对，就这样别放手~": "Yes, don't let go~",
  "好孩子，交给我吧": "Good boy, leave it to me",
  "0就在这里哦♥": "Zero is right here♥",
  "不用再数下去了": "No need to keep counting",
  // 台词 · 松手
  "松开了？还在逞强呢": "Let go? Still being stubborn",
  "差一点点就能赦免了": "You were so close to absolution",
  "退缩了呢，真可惜~": "You flinched. What a shame~",
  "手在发抖哦，还要忍？": "Your hand is trembling. Still enduring?",
  // 台词 · 放弃-前段
  "才刚开始就来告解了？好诚实♥": "Confessing already? How honest♥",
  "这么快就跪下，是合格的信徒呢": "Kneeling so soon. A proper believer",
  "温柔的修女，会接住早退的你": "A gentle nun will catch you, even when you drop out early",
  // 台词 · 放弃-中段
  "中途认输，也算一种诚实的祷告": "Giving up halfway is an honest prayer too",
  "看吧，忍耐并没有比较神圣哦": "See? Enduring isn't any holier",
  "我收下了。这就是你的告解~": "I accept it. This is your confession~",
  // 台词 · 放弃-后段
  "都到最后了，还是选择被赦免呢": "All the way to the end, and you still chose absolution",
  "撑了这么久，输的时候会更甜": "After holding on so long, losing tastes even sweeter",
  "好孩子。败北，我也替你祷告了": "Good boy. I've said a prayer for your defeat too",
  // 台词 · 暂停
  "[暂停·嘲讽占位1]": "[Pause taunt placeholder 1]",
  "[暂停·嘲讽占位2]": "[Pause taunt placeholder 2]",
  "[暂停·嘲讽占位3]": "[Pause taunt placeholder 3]",
  "[暂停·嘲讽占位4]": "[Pause taunt placeholder 4]",
  "[暂停·嘲讽占位5]": "[Pause taunt placeholder 5]",
  // 台词 · 撤退
  "[撤退·占位1]": "[Retreat placeholder 1]",
  "[撤退·占位2]": "[Retreat placeholder 2]",
  "[撤退·占位3]": "[Retreat placeholder 3]",
  // 台词 · 败北
  "[003·败北·占位1]": "[003 defeat placeholder 1]",
  "[003·败北·占位2]": "[003 defeat placeholder 2]",
  "[003·败北·占位3]": "[003 defeat placeholder 3]",
  // 台词 · 处决-前言
  "主动来领惩罚的信徒，我最喜欢了": "I adore believers who come to receive their punishment themselves",
  "不许移开视线。从十开始，听我数": "Don't look away. From ten, listen to me count",
  "数到零的时候，你就彻底属于我了": "When I reach zero, you'll belong to me completely",
  // 台词 · 处决-cutin
  "听好了": "Listen well",
  "归零吧": "Down to zero",
  // 台词 · 处决-倒数
  "{n}……听好": "{n}… listen",
  "还剩{n}哦~": "{n} left~",
  "{n}，别躲": "{n}, don't hide",
  "好孩子…{n}": "Good boy… {n}",
  // 台词 · 处决-心声
  "会被数完…": "She'll count it all the way…",
  "不要零…": "Not zero…",
  // 台词 · 处决-归零
  "归零了": "Zero",
  "我的了♥": "Mine♥",
  "赦免你": "You're absolved",
  // 台词 · 处决-结算
  "彻底败北的祷告，我已经收下了哦": "I've received your prayer of utter defeat",
  "从今往后，数字都由我替你念♥": "From now on, I'll call out every number for you♥",
  // 台词 · 全部通过
  "居然撑到我把零交出去了呢…": "You actually held out until I gave up the zero…",
  "好孩子。不过，奖励还是我来选": "Good boy. But I still get to choose your reward",
  // 台词 · 讨伐成功
  "被讨伐了？那也算被我收下了吧~": "Subjugated? Then let's say I accepted it~",
  "下次来告解时，我会装作不认识": "Next time you come to confess, I'll pretend we've never met",
  // 台词 · 无尽战斗
  "永远不会数到零哦。习惯就好": "We'll never reach zero. You'll get used to it",
  "告解室的门已经锁上了，信徒": "The confessional door is already locked, my faithful",
  "还在等0吗？那是奖给认输的人的": "Still waiting for 0? That's a reward for those who surrender",
  "时间是我的。你只需要一直握着": "Time is mine. You just keep holding on",
  "被放过的魔物，会把你留下来的": "A monster you spared won't let you leave",
  "再数一轮？好啊，我有的是数字": "Another round of counting? Sure, I have all the numbers in the world",
  "勇者的任务书，已经没有用了吧": "A hero's quest sheet is no use anymore, is it?",
  "把『圣剑』交给我，当我的信徒": "Give me your \"Holy Sword\" and become my follower",
  "你看，撑着也没有人来救你哦": "See? No one's coming to save you, no matter how long you hold on",
  "赦免你了。所以这场祷告不会停": "I've absolved you. So this prayer will never end",
  "想结束的话，你知道0在哪里~": "If you want it to end, you know where 0 is~",
  "好孩子，就这样一直数下去吧♥": "Good boy. Let's keep counting like this forever♥",
  // 台词 · 无尽-放弃
  "永远里也可以中途认输哦": "Even in eternity, you can give up halfway",
