  // ================= 委托 004 =================
  // 委托单、提示条、定时演出（quest-004.jsonc）
  "虽然是认真战斗，也别忘了按照节奏挥舞『圣剑』哟": "Even in a serious fight, don't forget to swing your 『Holy Sword』 to the rhythm",
  "请耐心地认真观察，不要草率出手": "Watch patiently and carefully. Don't act rashly",
  "千万别错过了自己眼前出现的信息喔~": "Don't miss anything that appears right in front of you~",
  "速度越来越快了，『圣剑』还能撑得住吗？": "It's getting faster and faster. Can your 『Holy Sword』 hold out?",
  "停。准备好了吗？": "Stop. Ready?",
  // 剧情（story-004.jsonc）
  "通过初次任务几天后，你再次来到冒险者酒场。任务墙上，贴着一份指名给你的委托": "A few days after your First Quest, you return to the Adventurers' Tavern. On the Quest Board hangs a quest with your name on it.",
  "你来了呢~ 这份委托，是Aschan亲自为你写的哦♥": "You came~ Aschan wrote this quest for you personally♥",
  "Aschan？……这次又是新手任务吗？": "Aschan? …Another beginner quest?",
  "不是哦。你的实力，Aschan已经好好认可了。所以这一次……Aschan想认真地和你比一场": "Nope. Aschan properly recognizes your strength now. So this time… Aschan wants a serious match with you.",
  "认真地……比一场？": "A serious… match?",
  "嗯。这一次，Aschan会用尽一切办法，让你心甘情愿地输掉哦♥": "Mm-hm. This time, Aschan will use every trick there is to make you lose willingly♥",
  "这次不会放过你了♥": "I won't let you off this time♥",
  "最后一组的数字归零。你终于撑过了Aschan的全部诱惑": "The last set's count hits zero. You've finally withstood every temptation Aschan threw at you.",
  "……真的赢了呢。看来是Aschan有点小看你了": "…You really won. Looks like Aschan underestimated you a little.",
  "哈啊……哈啊……这次可一点都不轻松……": "Hah… hah… That was anything but easy…",
  "输了就是输了哦。那么，胜利者——想怎么处置Aschan呢？♥": "A loss is a loss. So, victor, what will you do with Aschan?♥",
  "嗯~？赢了却不给最后一击吗？": "Hmm~? You won, but no final blow?",
  "那就是……还想一直留在Aschan身边吧♥ 好啊，Aschan会一直陪着你的": "Which means… you want to stay by Aschan's side forever♥ Sure, Aschan will keep you company always",
  "胜负没有结束。Aschan又一次向你靠了过来": "The match isn't over. Aschan draws close to you once more.",
  "还撑得住吗？": "Can you still hold on?",
  "是你赢了哦……要给Aschan最后一击吗？♥": "You win… will you deliver the final blow to Aschan?♥",
  "再比一场": "One more match",
  // 台词 · 委托开场
  "这份委托，是Aschan特意为你写的哦……要好好收下♥": "Aschan wrote this quest especially for you… Accept it properly♥",
  "初次任务时对你太温柔了呢。这次，Aschan想认真地让你输掉~": "I went too easy on you on your First Quest. This time, Aschan wants to make you lose for real~",
  "撑过四组就算你赢……不过，你真的想赢吗？♥": "Survive four sets and you win… but do you really want to win?♥",
  // 台词 · 准备
  "握好『圣剑』……眼睛也要一直看着Aschan哦": "Grip your \"Holy Sword\"… and keep your eyes on Aschan the whole time",
  "放轻松~ 越紧张，就越容易被Aschan吸进去哦": "Relax~ The tenser you are, the easier Aschan pulls you in",
  "准备好了吗？这一次，Aschan不会只是看着了": "Ready? This time, Aschan won't just watch",
  "深呼吸……然后，把注意力全部交给Aschan♥": "Deep breath… then give all your attention to Aschan♥",
  // 台词 · 前段
  "这一次，Aschan会一直陪在你身边哦♥": "This time, Aschan will stay right by your side♥",
  "节奏很稳呢……还能稳多久呢？": "Your rhythm's steady… for how much longer?",
  "认真的表情，让Aschan更想欺负你了~": "That serious face makes Aschan want to tease you even more~",
  "初次任务的时候，你可没这么紧张呢♥": "You weren't this nervous on your First Quest♥",
  "想看就看吧……反正你会越看越输的": "Look if you want… the more you look, the more you lose anyway",
  "慢慢来~ Aschan有的是时间陪你": "Take your time~ Aschan has all the time in the world for you",
  "你专心的样子，Aschan很喜欢哦": "Aschan loves how focused you look",
  "输给Aschan，一点都不丢人哦♥": "Losing to Aschan is nothing to be ashamed of♥",
  // 台词 · 中段
  "呼吸乱了呢……Aschan全都听见了哦": "Your breathing's a mess… Aschan can hear all of it",
  "手忙脚乱的样子，好可爱♥": "You're so cute when you're flustered♥",
  "刚才那一下，心跳漏了一拍吧？": "Your heart skipped a beat just now, didn't it?",
  "『圣剑』和眼睛，只能顾得上一边呢~": "Your \"Holy Sword\" or your eyes… you can only manage one~",
  "越想赢，就越会被Aschan吸引哦": "The more you want to win, the more Aschan draws you in",
  "视线又飘到不该看的地方了呢♥": "Your eyes wandered somewhere they shouldn't again♥",
  "再靠近一点……让你没办法专心~": "Let me get a little closer… so you can't concentrate~",
  "嘴上说要赢，身体可一点都不配合哦": "Your mouth says you'll win, but your body isn't cooperating at all",
  "Aschan在等你露出破绽呢……慢慢来♥": "Aschan's waiting for you to slip… take your time♥",
  "好想快点看到你输掉的表情呀~": "I can't wait to see your face when you lose~",
  // 台词 · 后段
  "已经到极限了吧？认输会很舒服的哦♥": "You're at your limit, right? Surrendering will feel so good♥",
  "手在发抖呢……还要继续逞强吗？": "Your hand's shaking… still acting tough?",
  "最后这几秒，Aschan会把一切都给你♥": "For these last few seconds, Aschan will give you everything♥",
  "只要一个失误，就全部结束了哦~": "One mistake and it's all over~",
  "看不清了吧？闭上眼睛，交给Aschan就好": "You can't see straight anymore, right? Close your eyes and leave it to Aschan",
  "『圣剑』快要握不住了呢♥": "You can barely hold your \"Holy Sword\"♥",
  "就这样输给Aschan吧……好不好？": "Just lose to Aschan like this… okay?",
  "已经赢不了了哦……乖乖投降吧♥": "You can't win anymore… be good and surrender♥",
  // 台词 · cutin-前到中
  "要开始认真了哦♥": "Getting serious now♥",
  "心跳乱了呢~": "Your heartbeat's a mess~",
  "还跟得上吗？♥": "Still keeping up?♥",
  "再贴近一点~": "Let me get closer~",
  // 台词 · cutin-中到后
  "快要输了吧♥": "About to lose, aren't you♥",
  "别再逞强了哦~": "Stop acting tough~",
  "全部交出来吧♥": "Give it all up♥",
  "该投降了呢~": "Time to surrender~",
  // 台词 · 长按中
  "对……就这样慢慢按下去♥": "Yes… press down slowly, just like that♥",
  "要把胜利交给Aschan了吗？": "Handing your victory to Aschan?",
  "乖孩子，再按久一点~": "Good boy, hold it a bit longer~",
  "输掉的感觉，很温柔哦♥": "Losing feels so gentle♥",
  // 台词 · 松手
  "明明很想按下去的吧？♥": "You really wanted to press it, didn't you?♥",
  "嘴硬的样子也好可爱~": "You're cute even when you're stubborn~",
  "差一点就属于Aschan了呢": "You were this close to belonging to Aschan",
  "下次就别松开了哦♥": "Don't you let go next time♥",
  // 台词 · 放弃-前段
  "才刚开始就投降了呢……真是乖孩子♥": "Surrendering right at the start… such a good boy♥",
  "Aschan还没认真，你就交出胜利了？": "Aschan hasn't even gotten serious and you're handing over the win?",
  "这么快……是一开始就想输给Aschan吧？♥": "This fast… you wanted to lose to Aschan from the start, didn't you?♥",
  // 台词 · 放弃-中段
  "被Aschan迷得撑不下去了呢♥": "Too enchanted by Aschan to hold on♥",
  "中途投降的你，也很可爱哦~": "You're cute even when you give up halfway~",
  "嗯……这一场，是属于Aschan的了♥": "Mm… this round belongs to Aschan♥",
  // 台词 · 放弃-后段
  "就差一点点……还是输给Aschan了呢♥": "So close… and you still lost to Aschan♥",
  "最后松手的样子，好让人心动~": "The way you let go at the end makes my heart flutter~",
  "坚持到这里很努力了哦。不过，你输了♥": "You worked hard to get this far. But you lose♥",
  // 台词 · 暂停
  "这一组算你撑过来了呢。下一组，Aschan会贴得更近一点哦♥": "Fine, you survived this set. Next set, Aschan's getting even closer♥",
  "比想象中还能忍嘛……这样的你，让Aschan更想认真击溃了~": "You can hold out longer than I thought… That just makes Aschan want to crush you for real~",
  "呼吸还没平复吧？没关系，下一组会让你更乱的♥": "Still catching your breath? Don't worry, the next set will leave you even more of a mess♥",
  "刚才好几次，差一点就是Aschan的了呢。下一组可别再逃掉哦~": "Several times just now, you almost became Aschan's. Don't get away next set~",
  "眼睛有点花了？下一组，会让你更加移不开视线的♥": "Seeing stars? Next set, you won't be able to look away at all♥",
  // 台词 · 撤退
  "要走了吗？那这一场就算Aschan赢了哦♥": "Leaving already? Then this round goes to Aschan♥",
  "逃走的背影，Aschan会好好记住的~": "Aschan will remember the sight of you running away~",
  "下次再来吧……Aschan会等你回来认输哦♥": "Come back next time… Aschan will be waiting for you to surrender♥",
  // 台词 · 败北
  "抓到你了♥ 这一局，是Aschan赢了哦": "Got you♥ This round goes to Aschan",
  "一次失误就结束了呢……认真的Aschan很可怕吧？": "One slip and it's over… Serious Aschan is scary, isn't she?",
  "慢了一点点呢~ 输给Aschan的感觉怎么样？": "Just a little too slow~ How does losing to Aschan feel?",
  // 台词 · 败北-点击
  "伸手慢了一拍呢……Aschan已经贴上来了♥": "Reached out a beat too late… Aschan's already pressed against you♥",
  "犹豫了呢~ 被迷住的那一瞬间，就输了哦": "You hesitated~ The moment you got entranced, you lost",
  // 台词 · 败北-按住
  "一松手，就被Aschan压下去了呢♥": "The moment you let go, Aschan pinned you down♥",
  "没力气了？那就乖乖躺好吧~": "Out of strength? Then just lie down like a good boy~",
  // 台词 · 败北-拖动
  "追不上了呢……Aschan就在前面等你哦♥": "Couldn't catch up… Aschan's waiting just ahead♥",
  "停下来了？是舍不得追到Aschan吗~": "You stopped? Couldn't bear to actually catch Aschan~?",
  // 台词 · 败北-顺序
  "数乱了呢……满脑子都是Aschan吧？♥": "Lost count… your head's full of Aschan, isn't it?♥",
  "顺序错了哦~ 心已经不在这里了呢": "Wrong order~ Your heart's not here anymore",
  // 台词 · 挑战-中诱饵
  "上钩了♥ 现在只看得见Aschan了吧？": "Hooked♥ All you can see is Aschan now, right?",
  "那是Aschan特意留给你的陷阱哦~": "That was a trap Aschan set just for you~",
  "头晕了吗？就这样沉下去吧♥": "Dizzy? Just sink down like this♥",
  "看不清也没关系……Aschan就在这里哦": "Can't see straight? That's okay… Aschan's right here",
  // 台词 · 败北-连打
  "挣不开呢……就这样被Aschan缠住吧♥": "Can't break free… just let Aschan wrap around you♥",
  "没力气了？那就不要再挣扎了哦~": "Out of strength? Then stop struggling~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-点击
  "Aschan要靠近了哦……接得住吗？♥": "Aschan's coming closer… can you take it?♥",
  "看清楚再伸手哦，不然会被抓住的~": "Look carefully before you reach, or you'll get caught~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-顺序
  "Aschan来倒数……你要好好跟上哦♥": "Aschan's counting down… keep up♥",
  "从大的开始，慢慢数给Aschan听~": "Start from the biggest and count them out for Aschan, slowly~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-连打
  "被缠住了呢……想挣脱就用力吧♥": "You're all tangled up… struggle hard if you want out♥",
  "Aschan可不会轻易放开你哦~": "Aschan won't let you go that easily~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-点击+点击
  "两边都要顾好哦……很辛苦吧？♥": "Watch both sides… tough, isn't it?♥",
  "一只手可不够用呢~": "One hand won't cut it~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-顺序4
  "再多数一个……别在Aschan面前数乱哦♥": "Count one more… don't lose count in front of Aschan♥",
  "数字变多了呢，脑袋还清醒吗？": "More numbers now. Is your head still clear?",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-按住
  "被Aschan按住了呢……可别松开哦♥": "Aschan's got you pinned… don't let go♥",
  "撑住~ 一松手就是Aschan的了": "Hang on~ Let go and you're Aschan's",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-按住零
  "最后那一下，要好好按住才算数哦♥": "That last one only counts if you hold it properly♥",
  "0可不会那么轻易给你哦~": "Aschan won't give you 0 that easily~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-按住陷阱
  "按住了？那这边，你要怎么办呢♥": "Holding that one? Then what about this side♥",
  "两只手都被Aschan占满了呢~": "Both your hands are full of Aschan~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-诱饵
  "有些东西……碰了就回不去了哦♥": "Some things… once you touch them, there's no going back♥",
  "看仔细，别被Aschan的陷阱骗了~": "Look closely, don't fall for Aschan's traps~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-登场-拖动
  "Aschan要走了哦……追上来吧♥": "Aschan's leaving… come after me♥",
  "别跟丢了呢，Aschan会等你的~": "Don't lose track of me. Aschan will wait for you~",
  // 台词 · 挑战-引诱放弃
  "累了吧？按这里……就能休息了哦♥": "Tired? Press here… and you can rest♥",
