  // 台词 · 挑战-决胜
  "最后一次了哦……接住Aschan的全部吧♥": "This is the last one… take everything Aschan's got♥",
  "赢了就能讨伐Aschan……你真的舍得吗？": "Win and you'll defeat Aschan… can you really bear to?",
  // 台词 · 挑战-命中
  "唔……接住了呢": "Mm… you caught it",
  "反应真快呀♥": "Such quick reflexes♥",
  "嗯~ 有点心动了": "Mm~ my heart fluttered a little",
  "下一次可没这么简单哦": "It won't be this easy next time",
  "居然没被迷住？": "You didn't get entranced?",
  "这样的你更诱人了♥": "That makes you even more tempting♥",
  "Aschan要更认真了哦": "Aschan's getting more serious",
  "还能撑多久呢~": "How long can you hold out~",
  // 台词 · 处决-前言
  "结束了呢……是Aschan赢了哦♥": "It's over… Aschan wins♥",
  "那么，就由Aschan来温柔地给你最后一击吧~": "Now then, let Aschan gently deliver the final blow~",
  "数到0的时候，要彻底认输给Aschan哦♥": "When it hits 0, surrender to Aschan completely♥",
  // 台词 · 处决-cutin
