  "想结束的话，认输就好了哦~": "If you want it to end, just surrender~",
  "胜负什么的，交给Aschan来决定吧♥": "Leave winning and losing to Aschan♥",
  "你的眼里，已经只剩下Aschan了呢": "There's nothing left in your eyes but Aschan",
