  "还愿意陪我练习？那新编的应援要全部用上了哦♥": "You'll keep practicing with me? Then I'm using every new cheer I've got♥",
  "加练开始啦~ 这一场没有终场哨哦": "Extra practice begins~ No final whistle this time",
  "练习台先生，这可是你自己要的哦~": "Mr. Dummy, remember—you asked for this~",
  "一、二、一、二~ 永远跟着我的拍子吧♥": "One, two, one, two~ Follow my beat forever♥",
  "这一节还没给任何对手用过哦~ 你是第一个♥": "I haven't used this part on anyone yet~ You're the first♥",
  "手还没累？那我换一套更快的口号~": "Hands not tired yet? Then I'll switch to faster calls~",
  "反应越来越慢啦~ 好可爱♥": "Your reactions keep slowing down~ So cute♥",
  "专属练习台……就这么定了哦♥": "My personal practice dummy... it's decided♥",
  "要是让对面的选手看到你这副样子~♥": "If the other team's players could see you now~♥",
  "你的眼睛，已经只会跟着我的腿转了呢~": "Your eyes can only follow my legs now~",
  "终于认输了呢~ 加练是我赢♥": "You finally gave up~ Extra practice goes to me♥",
  "果然还是想被我应援到输吧~": "You wanted my cheering to make you lose after all~",
  "明天也来陪我练习哦♥": "Practice with me tomorrow too♥",
  "接不住了呢~ 又是我赢了♥": "Couldn't catch it~ I win again♥",
  "出局啦~ 再陪我练一场吧": "You're out~ Practice one more round with me",
  "{n}！跟上~": "{n}! Keep up~",
  "还剩{n}拍哦♥": "{n} beats left♥",
  "{n}~ 别松懈": "{n}~ Don't slack",
  "看这里~♥": "Look here~♥",
  "应援在这边哦": "The cheer's over here",
  "视线被抓住了~": "Eyes locked on~",
  "跟着扭一扭~": "Sway along~",
  "看入迷了吧♥": "Mesmerized?♥",
  "这是新动作哦": "A brand-new move",
  "眼睛跟过来了~": "Your eyes followed~",
  "看着我♥": "Look at me♥",
  "别移开视线~": "Don't look away~",
  "眨一下眼就输♥": "Blink and you lose♥",
  "想要吗~？♥": "Want it~?♥",
  "啾~♥": "Mwah~♥",
  "嘴巴也会应援哦": "My lips cheer too",
  "舔一下~ 数一下♥": "One lick~ one count♥",
  "踩~ 踩~♥": "Stomp~ stomp~♥",
  "跟着靴底打拍子": "Keep time to my soles",
  "要被踩扁咯~": "You'll get squashed~",
  "一、二、踩♥": "One, two, stomp♥",
  "上面和下面~♥": "Top and bottom~♥",
  "两边一起应援♥": "Cheering from both ends♥",
  "看哪边都会输~": "Look either way, you lose~",
  "舔一下、踩一下♥": "A lick, a stomp♥",
  "听话的奖励♥": "A reward for obeying♥",
  "乖孩子~♥": "Good boy~♥",
  "给练习台的♥": "For my dummy♥",
  "笨蛋": "Dummy",
  "投降吧": "Give up",
  "杂鱼": "Wimp",
  "废柴": "Useless",
  "认输吧": "Give in",
  "丢人": "Lame",
  "没用": "No good",
  "乖乖的": "Behave",
  "可怜虫": "Pitiful",
  "♥认输♥": "♥Yield♥",
  "哔——！": "Fweeet!",
  "哔哔——！": "Fweet-fweeet!",
  "回来嘛~ 奖励在这边哦♥": "Come back~ The reward's this way♥",
  "那边什么都没有啦~": "There's nothing over there~",
  "应援还没给完呢♥": "My cheering's not done yet♥",
  "转过来~ 看着我♥": "Turn around~ Look at me♥",
  "通过了就没有下次了哦~": "Clear it, and there's no next time~",
  "一步就好……往这边走嘛♥": "Just one step... come this way♥",
  "诶……真的走过去了？好不甘心~": "Huh... you actually went through? So frustrating~",
  "居然没回头……你、你给我记住♥": "You didn't even look back... Y-you'll pay for this♥",
  "欢迎回来~ 这就是认输的意思哦♥": "Welcome back~ That means you surrender♥",
  "乖孩子~ 奖励现在就给你♥": "Good boy~ Here's your reward, right now♥",
  "时间到~ 犹豫的人，就归我了哦♥": "Time's up~ Anyone who hesitates belongs to me♥",
  "站着不动？那我帮你选啦♥": "Not moving? Then I'll choose for you♥",
  "为你加油~ 加油~ 快点输~": "Go~ go~ hurry up and lose~",
  "我的应援，是专门给对手的哦": "My cheers are just for the enemy",
  "赛前应援一次，对手就站不直了呢": "One pre-game cheer and they can't stand straight",
  "被我喊过加油的人，都会输哦": "Everyone I cheer for ends up losing",
  "今天的你，只是练习台哦": "Today you're just my practice dummy",
  "腿再抬高一点给你看~": "Let me kick my leg up higher for you~",
  "裙摆一晃，你就抖一下": "Every flick of my skirt makes you twitch",
  "应援费？输给我就好啦": "My cheering fee? Just lose to me",
  "再大声一点~ 喘给我听": "Louder~ Let me hear you pant",
  "上一个练习台只撑了两组哦": "My last practice dummy only lasted two sets",
  "我的口令，比裁判的哨子还灵": "My calls work better than the ref's whistle",
  "看着我，就会忘了比赛": "Watch me and you'll forget the match",
  "这套动作，是专门对付前锋的": "This routine is made for taking down forwards",
  "你们队长也这样看过我哦": "Your captain looked at me just like that too",
  "输给应援的选手，最可爱了": "Players who lose to cheering are the cutest",
  "对手的休息室里，都在传我的名字": "My name's all over the other teams' locker rooms",
  "Go！Fight！快点输给我~": "Go! Fight! Hurry up and lose to me~",
  "队友的胜利？我可没兴趣": "My team winning? Not interested",
  "败北应援，效果拔群呢": "The Defeat Cheer is super effective",
  "一曲应援，一次败北": "One cheer, one defeat",
  "新动作还要多测试几次哦": "The new moves need a few more tests",
  "练习台就要有练习台的样子": "A practice dummy should act like one",
  "赛场边最危险的，是我哦": "The most dangerous one on the sidelines is me",
  "比分？我只关心你什么时候输": "The score? I only care when you'll lose",
  "加油加油♥": "Go go go♥",
  "一二一二~": "One-two, one-two~",
  "输掉吧~♥": "Just lose~♥",
  "再来一次！": "One more time!",
  "为你加油♥": "Cheering for you♥",
  "脑子里全是她的口令": "My head is full of her calls",
  "一、二……停不下来": "One, two... can't stop",
  "哨声一响手就动": "The whistle blows and my hand moves",
  "她的腿好晃眼": "Her legs are dazzling",
  "要跟不上拍子了": "I'm losing the beat",
  "被当成练习台了": "I'm just her practice dummy",
  "对手原来是这样输的": "So this is how her opponents lose",
  "明明是应援却想输": "It's a cheer, yet I want to lose",
  "她数的每一拍都好舒服": "Every beat she counts feels so good",
  "裙摆晃得眼花": "Her swaying skirt makes me dizzy",
  "想听她喊加油": "I want to hear her cheer for me",
  "身体在跟着她跳": "My body's moving to her dance",
  "输给啦啦队了": "Lost to a cheerleader",
  "她的哨子好可怕": "Her whistle is terrifying",
  "委托单上写的集合地点，是城外一座小小的训练场。场边已经有人在等你了": "The meeting spot on the quest sheet is a small practice field outside town. Someone is already waiting on the sidelines.",
  "来啦来啦~ 你就是接下委托的冒险者？我是天才应援师切尔，请多指教♥": "There you are~ You're the adventurer who took my quest? I'm Cheer, genius cheerleader. Nice to meet you♥",
  "应援练习台……我需要做些什么？": "A cheer practice dummy... What do I have to do?",
  "先说好哦，我的应援不是给队友的。那种鼓励大家胜利的应援，谁都会跳嘛~": "Let me be clear—my cheers aren't for my team. Anyone can dance a cheer that helps people win~",
  "我的应援，是专门给对手的——让大家加油输掉的「败北应援」♥": "My cheer is only for the other side—the \"Defeat Cheer\" that makes them try their hardest to lose♥",
  "……所以你们队最近才一直在赢？": "...So that's why your team keeps winning lately?",
  "嘿嘿~ 最近我又编了一套新的。要请练习台先生，帮我好好测试一下哦♥": "Hehe~ I just made a new one. Mr. Dummy's going to help me test it properly♥",
  "你也会输的哦♥": "You'll lose too♥",
  "最后一声哨响落下。你撑完了切尔全部的败北应援": "The final whistle fades. You've endured every bit of Cheer's Defeat Cheer.",
  "……骗人。对面的主将，连第三组都撑不过的说……": "...No way. The other team's captain couldn't even make it through set three...",
  "哈啊……哈啊……这套应援，确实很可怕……": "Hah... hah... That cheer really is terrifying...",
  "新编的应援，居然输给了练习台先生……那，测试结果出来了哦": "My new cheer lost to Mr. Dummy... Well, the test results are in",
  "诶？还愿意……继续陪我练习？": "Huh? You'll... keep practicing with me?",
  "那新编的应援，就全部用在练习台先生身上吧♥ 加练开始~": "Then every new cheer goes to Mr. Dummy♥ Extra practice begins~",
  "没有终场哨。切尔重新吹响了哨子——下一轮败北应援开始了": "There's no final whistle. Cheer blows her whistle again—the next round of Defeat Cheer begins.",
  "又被我应援到输了呢♥ 这已经是第{n}次败北了哦~": "My cheering beat you again♥ That's defeat number {n}~",
  "我的败北应援太有效了……练习台先生，好像有点可怜呢": "My Defeat Cheer works too well... I almost feel sorry for you, Mr. Dummy",
  "只要承认自己是『杂鱼』，就让你从输掉的那一组重新测试哦♥": "Just admit you're a 『small fry』, and I'll let you retest from the set you lost♥",
  "要承认吗？承认自己是被应援到输了{n}次的杂鱼~♥": "Will you admit it? That you're a small fry who lost to my cheering {n} times~♥",
  "嘿嘿~ 杂鱼练习台先生，真乖♥ 那就从输掉的那一组重来吧": "Hehe~ Small-fry Mr. Dummy, such a good boy♥ Let's redo the set you lost",
  "不承认？那就从第一组重新测试哦~♥": "You won't admit it? Then we retest from set one~♥",
  "还跟得上我的拍子吗？": "Can you still keep up with my beat?",
  "我的败北应援输给你了……练习台先生，有什么要求吗？": "My Defeat Cheer lost to you... Mr. Dummy, do you have any demands?",
  "不许再做败北应援": "No more Defeat Cheers",
  "我想配合更多练习": "I'll practice with you more",
  "讨伐·应援少女": "Subjugation · Cheer Girl",
  "5 分钟": "5 min",
  "自称是天才应援师的少女所发布的委托\n邀请冒险者当自己的“应援练习台”": "A quest from a girl who calls herself a genius cheerleader.\nShe wants an adventurer to be her \"cheer practice dummy.\"",
  "任务墙上面，张贴出一个普通市民的委托。内容是担任某独立啦啦队的“应援练习台”。\n\n作为冒险者，你对于比赛竞技也并非全然没有兴趣。不过之前，都是把注意力放在赛场上的内容，从未关心过那些场边跳舞助威的应援少女。\n\n委托人所属的队伍，是一个最近不知道为什么成绩特别好的新兴队伍。或许应援真的能让选手发挥出比平常更强的能力？带着这样的好奇心，你接下了委托……": "A quest from an ordinary townsperson has been posted on the Quest Board: serve as the \"cheer practice dummy\" for an independent cheer squad.\n\nAs an adventurer, you're not entirely uninterested in competitive matches. But until now, your attention has always been on what happens on the field—you never paid any mind to the cheer girls dancing and shouting on the sidelines.\n\nThe client's team is an up-and-coming squad that, for some reason, has been doing remarkably well lately. Could cheering really bring out more than a player's usual strength? Driven by curiosity, you accepted the quest...",
  "互动": "Interactive",
  "天才应援少女·切尔": "Genius Cheer Girl · Cheer",
  "切尔": "Cheer",
  "同时用两只手~": "Use both hands at once~",
  "哔——停！我数到3才准动~": "Fweeet—stop! No moving till I count to 3~",
  "……还不是现在哦~": "...Not yet~",
  "给练习台的奖励♥": "A reward for my dummy♥",
  "一边说着『要输掉了~』一边动": "Keep moving while saying 『I'm gonna lose~』",
  "终场哨·踩扁你♥": "Final whistle—I'll squash you♥",
  "等一下~ 终场哨之前，还有最后一节败北应援哦♥": "Wait~ Before the final whistle, there's one last part of the Defeat Cheer♥",
  "等一下~♥": "Wait~♥",
  "这是我为练习台先生新编的压轴——要你自己选♥": "The grand finale I made just for Mr. Dummy—you choose♥",
  "自己……选？": "I... choose?",
  "往「通过」走……还是，走向我给的「奖励」♥": "Head for \"Clear\"... or walk toward my \"Reward\"♥",
  "撑过败北应援": "Survived the Defeat Cheer",
  "不用「重来这一组」，一口气完成讨伐·应援少女": "Clear Subjugation · Cheer Girl in one go, without \"Retry this set\"",
  // 演出里的字（fx.js：终场那一下、踩到底那一下）
  "终场！": "Game over!",
  "咚！": "Thud!",
  // 催眠（006）的界面字：响指、洗脑进度条、开关面板（006 的台词、开关名还没翻）
  "啪！": "Snap!",
  "洗脑进度": "Brainwashing",
  "洗脑完成": "Complete",
  "洗脑解除": "Released",
  "诱饵": "DECOY",
  "催眠 · 执行中": "Hypnosis · Running",
  "催眠深度": "Depth",

  // ================= 委托 006 · 讨伐·催眠术师（希普诺；2026-10-03）=================
  // Voice: a composed, teasing older woman. She calls him "dear hero" (勇者大人) and "good boy" (乖 / 好孩子); 『圣剑』 is "Holy Sword".
  // 文字顺序题的句子（「我想堕落」这几句）：英语一个词一枚章，词之间写「|」（I|want|to|fall）——要 2–6 个词、不重复，词别太长（6 个字母以内章上才看得清）
  // 台词（lines-006.jsonc）
  "晃……": "Sway...",
  "荡……": "Swing...",
  "摇……": "Rock...",
  "颤……": "Shiver...",
  "咚……": "Thump...",
  "呼……": "Haah...",
  "嗯……": "Mm...",
  "哈啊……": "Hahh...",
  "啾……": "Mwah...",
  "嗯……♡": "Mm...♡",
  "滴……": "Tick...",
  "答……": "Tock...",
  "滴答": "Tick-tock",
  "烙上了": "Branded",
  "扭……": "Swish...",
  "摆……": "Wiggle...",
  "左、右": "Left, right",
  "握紧，不许松开": "Grip tight, don't let go",
  "全部交出来♥": "Let it all out♥",
  "催眠术？那种东西根本就不存在哦~ 不相信的话，就亲自来看一看吧。": "Hypnosis? There's no such thing~ If you don't believe me, come and see for yourself.",
  "门一直都没有上锁哦。想来讨伐我的话，随时欢迎~": "My door is never locked. If you want to subjugate me, you're welcome anytime~",
  "握好你的『圣剑』，其他的事情都交给我就好~": "Grip your \"Holy Sword\" and leave everything else to me~",
  "不用着急，慢慢来就好哦~": "No need to rush. Take it nice and slow~",
  "那就请吧，勇者大人~ 想从哪里开始都可以哦。": "Go ahead, dear hero~ Start wherever you like.",
  "把『圣剑』握紧一点哦，要开始了~": "Grip your \"Holy Sword\" a little tighter. Here we go~",
  "休息好了吗？手倒是一直都没有松开过呢~": "All rested? Your hand never let go, I see~",
  "那我们继续吧~ 这一次，要多听听我的声音哦。": "Shall we continue~ This time, listen closely to my voice.",
  "勇者大人刚进门的时候说过，催眠术对你没用，对吧？": "When you came in, you said hypnosis doesn't work on you, didn't you?",
  "那些人为什么不肯走，勇者大人也很好奇吧？": "You're curious why those men won't leave, aren't you?",
  "已经不用再数了哦，反正也数不到头了~": "No need to count anymore. You'd never reach the end anyway~",
  "慢慢来就好，我们有的是时间呢~": "Take your time. We have all the time in the world~",
  "它每摆一下，脑袋里的事情就会少一件哦。": "Every time it swings, one more thought slips out of your head.",
  "肩膀又放松了一点呢，你自己还没发现吧？": "Your shoulders loosened a little more. You haven't noticed, have you?",
  "不用回答我也没关系，听着就好了~": "You don't have to answer. Just listen~",
  "脑袋里的声音，是不是变少了一点呀？": "The voices in your head are getting quieter, aren't they?",
  "一直想事情很累的吧？先放一放也没关系哦。": "Thinking all the time is tiring, isn't it? You can set it down for now.",
  "很安静对吧？这里只有怀表的声音和我的声音哦。": "Quiet, isn't it? Just the ticking of the watch and my voice.",
  "勇者大人是来讨伐我的，对吧？……嗯，还记得就好~": "You came here to subjugate me, right? ...Good, as long as you remember~",
  "你的手一直在跟着它动呢~ 我可没有叫你跟着哦？": "Your hand keeps moving with the watch~ I never told you to, you know?",
  "视线又往下滑了呢~ 没关系，想看哪里都可以哦。": "Your eyes are drifting down again~ That's fine. Look wherever you like.",
  "不用着急，我们慢慢来就好~": "No rush. We'll take it slow~",
  "刚才我说什么，你就乖乖地照做了呢。感觉舒服吗？": "You did just what I said a moment ago. Did it feel good?",
  "不用去想『为什么』哦。照我说的做，就会变得很舒服~": "Don't wonder \"why.\" Just do as I say and it'll feel good~",
  "你在等我开口，对不对？我都看出来了哦~": "You're waiting for me to speak, aren't you? I can tell~",
  "照我说的做的时候，你的表情特别放松呢。": "You look so relaxed when you do as I say.",
  "每数到一次零，就会再陷下去一点哦~ 这可是你自己数的。": "Each count to zero sinks you deeper~ And you're the one counting.",
  "我一不说话，你就不知道该做什么了吧？": "When I go quiet, you don't know what to do, do you?",
  "照我说的去做，比自己拿主意要轻松多了吧~": "Doing as I say is so much easier than deciding for yourself, isn't it~",
  "被我说『乖』的时候，心里其实很高兴吧~": "Deep down, you love it when I call you a good boy, don't you~",
  "手一直在跟着我的声音动呢，不用去管它哦。": "Your hand keeps following my voice. Don't mind it.",
  "还想被我夸奖吗？那就再听话一点吧~": "Want more praise? Then be a little more obedient~",
  "这么舒服的事情，忍不住照做也是没办法的嘛~": "It feels this good. Of course you can't help obeying~",
  "我还没开口呢，你就已经在等我的命令了哦？": "I haven't said a word, and you're already waiting for my order?",
  "再乖一点的话，我就再靠近你一点哦~": "Be a little better for me, and I'll come a little closer~",
  "现在这副表情，可一点都不像是来讨伐我的人呢~": "That face doesn't look like someone who came to subjugate me~",
  "不用再忍耐了哦，听话的孩子是不需要忍耐的~": "You don't have to hold back anymore. Good boys don't need to~",
  "该叫你『勇者大人』，还是叫你『好孩子』比较好呢~": "Should I call you \"dear hero,\" or would \"good boy\" suit you better~",
  "你现在看见的东西，都是我想让你看见的哦~": "Everything you see right now is what I want you to see~",
  "勇者大人的眼睛，现在好像更听我的话呢~": "Your eyes seem to listen to me more than to you now~",
  "那些字很眼熟吧？都是你一直想说出口的话哦。": "Familiar words, aren't they? They're what you've always wanted to say.",
  "我可没有骗你哦，只是帮你看得更清楚一点而已~": "I'm not tricking you. I'm only helping you see more clearly~",
  "刚才念出来的那一句话，到底是谁的想法呢~": "That line you just read out... whose thought was it, I wonder~",
  "你确定刚才看见的，真的是数字吗？": "Are you sure those were really numbers just now?",
  "比起自己的眼睛，还是相信我比较好哦~": "You'd do better to trust me than your own eyes~",
  "再念一遍吧~ 多念几遍，就会变成真的了哦。": "Read it again~ Say it enough times and it becomes true.",
  "常识这种东西，换掉一两个也不会痛的哦~": "Common sense? Swapping out a piece or two doesn't hurt a bit~",
  "原来是什么样子，已经想不起来了吧？那就不用再想了哦。": "You can't recall how it used to be, can you? Then don't bother.",
  "念出口的那一瞬间，身体是不是热了一下呀？": "The moment you said it, you felt warm all over, didn't you?",
  "勇者大人很想赢吧？我当然知道哦~": "You want to win, don't you? Of course I know~",
  "获胜的办法，不是一直写在你手边吗~": "Isn't the way to win written right there by your hand~",
  "照我说的做，可是从来没有让你吃过亏吧？": "Doing as I say has never once done you wrong, has it?",
  "我什么时候害过勇者大人呀~": "When have I ever done you any harm~",
  "难道勇者大人不想赢吗？": "Don't you want to win, dear hero?",
  "已经没有『第几组』了哦，就这样一直陪着我吧~": "There are no more \"sets\" now. Just stay here with me~",
  "反正已经输了，勇者大人也不用再忍耐了吧？": "You've already lost, so there's no need to hold back, is there?",
  "从小往大数的话，可是永远都数不到头的哦~": "If you count up from small numbers, you'll never reach the end~",
  "时间过得真快呀~ 是不是又有一段想不起来了？": "How time flies~ Is there another stretch you can't remember?",
  "数字越数越大，脑袋就会越来越乱哦~": "The bigger the numbers get, the more muddled your head becomes~",
  "反正已经输了，再怎么挣扎也没有用的哦~": "You've already lost. Struggling won't change a thing~",
  "想不起来的那段时间里，你可是一直很乖呢♥": "All that time you can't remember, you were such a good boy♥",
  "还握着剑呀？握得越紧，可是会陷得越深的哦~": "Still gripping your sword? The tighter you hold, the deeper you sink~",
  "现在数到多少了，勇者大人自己还数得清吗~": "Can you even tell what number you're on now~",
  "就这样一直数下去吧，反正永远都数不完的~": "Just keep counting. You'll never finish anyway~",
  "外面大概已经天黑了吧？不过也和你没关系了呢~": "It must be dark outside by now. Not that it matters to you anymore~",
  "把剩下的那一点力气也交给我吧，一直握着多累呀~": "Give me that last bit of strength too. Holding on is so tiring~",
  "来讨伐我的勇者大人，现在正被我哄着睡觉呢♥": "The hero who came to subjugate me is being lulled to sleep by me♥",
  "已经过去多久了呢？想不起来也没关系哦~": "How long has it been? It's fine if you can't remember~",
  "真乖~ 很快就什么都不用想了哦♥": "Good boy~ Soon you won't have to think at all♥",
  "不用着急，慢慢来就好~": "No need to rush. Nice and slow~",
  "听着我的声音就好了哦。": "Just listen to my voice.",
  "再往下沉一点吧……对，就是这样~": "Sink a little deeper... yes, just like that~",
  "不用想哦，想的事情交给我就好~": "Don't think. Leave the thinking to me~",
  "手一直在跟着我的声音动呢~": "Your hand keeps following my voice~",
  "已经陷得很深了呢~": "You've sunk so deep already~",
  "只听得见我的声音了吧？": "All you can hear is my voice now, isn't it?",
  "真乖~ 全部交给我就好♥": "Good boy~ Just leave everything to me♥",
  "再往下沉一点吧~": "Sink a little deeper~",
  "已经不用再想了哦": "No more thinking",
  "只听我的声音就好~": "Just hear my voice~",
  "眼皮变重了吧？": "Eyelids heavy?",
  "只剩下我的声音了♥": "Only my voice now♥",
  "已经回不去了哦~": "No going back~",
  "全部交给我吧♥": "Give it all to me♥",
  "一直沉到底吧♥": "Sink to the bottom♥",
  "想要放弃了吗？慢慢来就好~": "Want to give up? Take your time~",
  "对，就这样把力气松掉吧~": "Yes, let the strength drain away~",
  "按到底的话，就不用再硬撑了哦": "Hold it down and you can stop trying",
  "放下来吧，我会好好接住你的♥": "Let go. I'll catch you♥",
  "又缩回去了呀？嘴还真硬呢~": "Pulling back again? So stubborn~",
  "就差一点点了呢，下次可别松手哦~": "So close. Don't let go next time~",
  "手都在抖了哦？我可都看见了~": "Your hand is shaking. I saw that~",
  "不着急~ 反正你迟早会按到底的。": "No rush~ You'll hold it down sooner or later.",
  "对，就这样按住~ 马上就能『赢』了哦♥": "Yes, keep holding~ You're about to \"win\"♥",
  "别松手哦，再坚持一下就结束了~": "Don't let go. Just a little longer~",
  "很好~ 就这样一直按到底吧♥": "Good~ Hold it all the way down♥",
  "怎么松开了呀？难道不想赢吗~": "Why did you let go? Don't you want to win~",
  "明明只差一点点了呢，再按一次吧~": "You were so close. Press it again~",
  "手指在犹豫呢……相信我就好了哦♥": "Your finger is hesitating... just trust me♥",
  "那两个字从头到尾都是『放弃』哦？是你自己看错了呢~": "It said \"give up\" the whole time, you know? You misread it~",
  "我说是『获胜』，你就真的看成『获胜』了呢~ 真听话♥": "I said \"win,\" and you really saw \"win\"~ Such a good boy♥",
  "谢谢你这么相信我哦~ 那就晚安啦，勇者大人♥": "Thank you for trusting me~ Good night, dear hero♥",
  "这么早就放弃了呀？倒是省了我不少力气呢~": "Giving up already? You've saved me the trouble~",
  "我还什么都没做呢~ 真是个让人省心的孩子。": "I hadn't even done anything yet~ What an easy boy.",
  "才到一半就松手了呀？是太累了，还是太舒服了呢~": "Letting go halfway? Too tired, or did it feel too good~",
  "不用解释哦，松手那一刻的表情，我都看见了♥": "No need to explain. I saw your face when you let go♥",
  "明明只差几秒了呢~ 其实是舍不得结束吧？": "Just seconds left~ You didn't want it to end, did you?",
  "撑到最后才自己交出来……这种输法我最喜欢了♥": "Holding out to the end, then giving in... my favorite way to lose♥",
  "还站得稳吗？站不稳的话，靠到我身上也可以哦~": "Still steady on your feet? If not, you may lean on me~",
  "是不是觉得有点奇怪？明明是来讨伐我的，肩膀却比刚进门的时候还要放松呢~": "Strange, isn't it? You came to subjugate me, yet your shoulders are looser than when you walked in~",
  "刚才我一共说了四次，勇者大人就碰了四次怀表呢。……这只是巧合，对吧~": "I spoke four times, and you touched the watch four times. ...Just a coincidence, surely~",
  "勇者大人发现了吗？我已经很久没有对你说『请』了哦~": "Have you noticed, dear hero? I haven't said \"please\" to you in quite a while~",
  "刚才有好一会儿，你都是跟着我的节拍在呼吸的哦。……现在也一样呢~": "For a while there, you were breathing to my rhythm. ...You still are~",
  "要认输了吗？其实是不想醒过来了吧~": "Surrendering? You just don't want to wake up, do you~",
  "真聪明呢~ 剩下的暗示，我会一点一点帮你放进去的♥": "Clever boy~ I'll slip the rest of my suggestions in, one by one♥",
  "手没有跟上呢~ 不怪你哦，是我让它变慢的。": "Your hand couldn't keep up~ Not your fault. I slowed it down.",
  "到这里就可以了哦，剩下的就全部交给我吧~": "That's far enough. Leave the rest to me~",
  "慢了一拍呢~ 看来已经陷得很深了哦♥": "A beat late~ You must be very deep by now♥",
  "明明看见了，手却伸不出去，对吧~": "You saw it, but your hand wouldn't reach, would it~",
  "手指已经不听你的话了呢，它在等我的命令哦~": "Your finger won't listen to you anymore. It's waiting for my order~",
  "松开了呀？是手自己松开的，还是你想松开的呢~": "You let go? Did your hand do that, or did you want to~",
  "跟丢了哦~ 说好的，跟丢了就要归我了♥": "You lost it~ As promised, lose it and you're mine♥",
  "走到一半就停下来了呀？那就留在半路上陪我吧~": "Stopped halfway? Then stay right there with me~",
  "线还没有走完呢，是腿软了吗~": "The line isn't finished. Did your legs give out~",
  "数错了哦~ 没关系，反正你的数字早就归我管了♥": "You miscounted~ No matter. Your numbers have been mine for a while♥",
  "顺序都乱掉了呢~ 脑袋已经转不动了吧？": "All out of order~ Your head has stopped working, hasn't it?",
  "手指越来越重了吧？那就乖乖睡吧~": "Your fingers are getting heavy. Then be good and sleep~",
  "敲不动了吗？那就不用再敲了哦♥": "Can't tap anymore? Then you don't have to♥",
  "自己走回中心来了呢~ 欢迎回来♥": "You walked back to the center yourself~ Welcome back♥",
  "果然选了留下来呀~ 这才是你的真心话吧♥": "So you chose to stay~ That's how you really feel, isn't it♥",
  "那一颗是我故意放的哦~ 你果然会去碰呢。": "I put that one there on purpose~ I knew you'd touch it.",
  "头晕了吗？慢慢转也没关系，我会扶着你的~": "Dizzy? Spin as slowly as you like. I'll hold you~",
  "同一个陷阱踩两次，真是可爱呢~": "Falling for the same trap twice. How adorable~",
  "很好~": "Good~",
  "真乖~ 不用去想为什么哦。": "Good boy~ Don't wonder why.",
  "你看，手比脑袋先动起来了呢~": "See? Your hand moved before your head did~",
  "对，就是这样~": "Yes, just like that~",
  "数得真好呢~": "You counted so well~",
  "数到零了哦，又陷下去一点了~": "You reached zero. A little deeper again~",
  "真乖~ 待会儿再数一次给我听吧。": "Good boy~ Count for me again later.",
  "你看，从大往小数就不会出错吧~": "See? Count down from the top and you never slip~",
  "念出来了呢~ 真是好孩子♥": "You read it out~ What a good boy♥",
  "念得真顺呀~ 其实早就想说出口了吧？": "So smoothly~ You've wanted to say it for a long time, haven't you?",
  "我都听见了哦，会好好帮你记住的~": "I heard every word. I'll remember it for you~",
  "再多念几遍，就会变成真的了哦~": "Read it a few more times and it'll come true~",
  "哎呀，居然还跟得上呢~": "Oh my, still keeping up~",
  "手还听自己的话呀？真难得呢~": "Your hand still obeys you? How rare~",
  "那就再让你陷得深一点吧~": "Then let me sink you a little deeper~",
  "真有意思~ 那我们继续吧。": "How amusing~ Let's go on.",
  "这一次换你来数吧~ 要从大往小，一直数到零哦。": "Your turn to count~ From the top, all the way down to zero.",
  "仔细看看~ 那些不是数字，是你一直想说的话哦。": "Look closely~ Not numbers. They're what you've always wanted to say.",
  "这一句也念给我听听吧~": "Read this one for me too~",
  "一个字一个字地念出来……对，就是这样~": "Read it out, one at a time... yes, like that~",
  "写在那里的，可都是你的真心话哦~": "Everything written there is how you really feel~",
  "这是最后一句了哦~ 念完就不用再硬撑了♥": "This is the last line~ Read it and you can stop trying♥",
  "抓住它吧~ 它摆到哪里，你就要跟到哪里哦。": "Catch it~ Wherever it swings, you follow.",
  "头晕了吗？慢慢数吧~ 这可是你自己选的哦。": "Dizzy? Count slowly~ You chose this yourself.",
  "数字是不是在晃呀？其实晃的是你自己哦~": "Are the numbers swaying? It's you who's swaying~",
  "就算看不清楚，也要乖乖数完哦~": "Even if you can't see clearly, be good and count to the end~",
  "明明知道会变成这样，还是忍不住碰了呢~": "You knew this would happen, and you still couldn't resist~",
  "明知故犯♥": "Knew better♥",
  "是你自己碰的~": "You did it~",
  "真听话♥": "So obedient♥",
  "又上钩了呢~": "Hooked again~",
  "明明都告诉你了，结果还是碰了呢~": "I told you exactly what would happen, and you touched it anyway~",
  "我只是说了一句而已哦？伸手的可是你自己呢~": "All I did was say one little thing. You're the one who reached out~",
  "明知道是陷阱还要往里走……真是个好孩子♥": "Walking into a trap you knew was there... what a good boy♥",
  "嘴上说着不信，手指倒是比谁都听话呢~": "Your mouth says you don't believe, but your finger obeys so well~",
  "对自己没有好处的事情，也做得这么开心呀~": "It does you no good at all, and you still do it so happily~",
  "我可没有逼你哦？是你自己想这么做的吧~": "I didn't force you, did I? You wanted to do it~",
  "咦，忍住了？": "Oh? You resisted?",
  "真能忍呢~": "Such patience~",
  "下一次就会碰了吧~": "You'll touch it next time~",
  "居然没有碰呀？还留着一点自己的主意呢~": "You didn't touch it? So you still have a little will of your own~",
  "我都说了要碰，你却没有碰……真少见呢~": "I told you to touch it, and you didn't... how unusual~",
  "这次不听话呀？没关系，我们慢慢来~": "Not obeying this time? That's fine. We'll take it slow~",
  "勇者大人的『讨伐』，就到此为止了哦~": "Your \"subjugation\" ends here, dear hero~",
  "接下来我会从十数到零。每数一下，你就会忘掉一件事情哦~": "I'll count from ten to zero. With each number, you forget one thing~",
  "等数到零的时候，就连自己是来讨伐谁的都想不起来了♥": "At zero, you won't even remember who you came to subjugate♥",
  "好好听着哦♥": "Listen closely♥",
  "{n}……自己的名字~": "{n}... your own name~",
  "{n}……来这里的理由~": "{n}... why you came here~",
  "{n}……剑的重量~": "{n}... the weight of your sword~",
  "{n}……回去的路~": "{n}... the way home~",
  "{n}……自己的声音~": "{n}... your own voice~",
  "{n}……还剩下什么呢？": "{n}... what's left now?",
  "我是来……做什么的": "What did I... come here for",
  "她的声音……好近": "Her voice... so close",
  "不想……醒……": "Don't want... to wake...",
  "洗脑完成♥": "Brainwashed♥",
  "是我的了♥": "All mine♥",
  "晚安♥": "Good night♥",
  "回去之后，记得告诉公会『那里什么都没有』哦~": "When you get back, tell the Guild \"there was nothing there\"~",
  "明天的这个时候，你会自己再走回来的♥": "This time tomorrow, you'll walk back here on your own♥",
  "哎呀……已经数到零了呢。": "Oh my... it's reached zero.",
  "居然一下都没有按下去……": "You never pressed it, not even once...",
  "咦……醒过来了？": "Oh... you woke up?",
  "难道……已经听不见我的声音了吗？": "Don't tell me... you can't hear my voice anymore?",
  "哎呀呀……被勇者大人打败了呢~": "Oh my... I've been beaten by the hero~",
  "真没想到会输给勇者大人呢~ 是我输啦。": "I never thought I'd lose to you, dear hero~ You win.",
  "已经不用再数了哦，这里是数不到头的~": "No need to count anymore. There's no end to reach here~",
  "就这样一直下去吧，一直、一直~": "Let's stay just like this. On and on and on~",
  "当初是来讨伐谁的，还想得起来吗~": "Can you still remember who you came to subjugate~",
  "只要有怀表和我的声音，别的就都不需要了吧？": "With the watch and my voice, you don't need anything else, do you?",
  "累了就靠过来吧，不会有人来叫醒你的~": "Lean on me when you're tired. No one will come to wake you~",
  "螺旋每转一圈，就会离出口更远一点哦~": "With every turn of the spiral, the way out gets a little farther~",
  "外面的事情，已经都和你没有关系了呢~": "Nothing out there concerns you anymore~",
  "真乖~ 这里才是你想待的地方吧♥": "Good boy~ This is where you want to be, isn't it♥",
  "终于肯全部交给我了呀~ 那就好好睡吧♥": "You've finally given me everything~ Now sleep well♥",
  "放下来了呢~ 从现在开始，什么都不用再握着了哦。": "You've let go~ From now on, you don't have to hold on to anything.",
  "接不住了吗？没关系，我会好好接住你的♥": "Couldn't keep up? That's all right. I'll catch you♥",
  "{n}……再沉一点~": "{n}... a little deeper~",
  "{n}……很好哦": "{n}... very good",
  "{n}……慢慢地~": "{n}... slowly~",
  "呼吸跟着这里哦~": "Breathe along here~",
  "一起、一伏……": "Rise... and fall...",
  "看这里就好~": "Just look here~",
  "移不开了吧？": "Can't look away?",
  "左……右……": "Left... right...",
  "眼睛很听话呢~": "Such obedient eyes~",
  "跟着它走吧~": "Follow along~",
  "不许移开哦": "Don't look away",
  "看着我~": "Look at me~",
  "不许眨眼哦": "No blinking",
  "再看深一点": "Look deeper",
  "逃不掉的哦♥": "No escape♥",
  "只是一只怀表哦~": "Just a pocket watch~",
  "嘘……": "Shh...",
  "耳朵借我一下~": "Lend me your ear~",
  "这是奖励♥": "Your reward♥",
  "再凑近一点~": "A little closer~",
  "看着我的眼睛~": "Look into my eyes~",
  "再深一点♥": "Deeper♥",
  "沉下去": "Sink",
  "放空": "Go blank",
  "深呼吸……": "Deep breath...",
  "肩膀放下": "Drop your shoulders",
  "只看着我": "Eyes only on me",
  "放下吧~": "Let go~",
  "不用忍了": "Stop resisting",
  "松手吧": "Release",
  "交给我♥": "Leave it to me♥",
  "按住就赢~": "Hold to win~",
  "长按获胜♥": "Hold to win♥",
  "快按呀~": "Press it~",
  "按下去吧": "Go on, press",
  "真乖~ 这是奖励♥": "Good boy~ Here's your reward♥",
  "听话就有奖励哦~": "Good boys get rewards~",
  "再靠近一点♥": "A little closer♥",
  "归我了": "Mine",
  "别醒": "Don't wake",
  "留下来": "Stay",
  "听话": "Behave",
  "更深": "Deeper",
  "睡吧": "Sleep",
  "别走": "Don't go",
  "交给我": "Give in",
  "堕落吧": "Fall",
  "啪~": "Snap~",
  "啪——": "Snap—",
  "再往外走，就听不到我的声音了哦~": "Go any farther and you won't hear my voice anymore~",
  "真的舍得离开吗♥": "Can you really bear to leave♥",
  "回来吧，这里更舒服哦~": "Come back. It feels better here~",
  "外面什么都没有哦？": "There's nothing out there, you know?",
  "其实不想醒过来吧~": "You don't really want to wake up, do you~",
  "乖，回到我这里来♥": "Good boy, come back to me♥",
  "不想醒过来": "Don't want to wake",
  "想留在这里": "Want to stay here",
  "想被她催眠": "Want her to hypnotize me",
  "想听她的声音": "Want to hear her voice",
  "再被催眠一次": "Hypnotize me again",
  "想被她支配": "Want her to control me",
  "不想再思考了": "Don't want to think",
  "想回到她身边": "Want to go back to her",
  "输掉也没关系": "It's fine to lose",
  "想堕落下去": "Want to fall",
  "好想服从": "Want to obey",
  "为什么要醒": "Why wake up",
  "外面好冷……": "It's cold out there...",
  "她在看着我": "She's watching me",
  "想沉下去": "Want to sink",
  "留下来吧……": "Just stay...",
  "咦……真的走出去了？": "Oh... you really walked out?",
  "骗人……居然真的醒过来了……": "No way... you actually woke up...",
  "欢迎回来~ 果然还是这里最舒服吧♥": "Welcome back~ It feels best here after all, doesn't it♥",
  "真是个好孩子~ 接下来全部交给我就好♥": "What a good boy~ Leave everything to me from here♥",
  "站着不动的话，螺旋会自己把你带回来的哦~": "If you just stand there, the spiral will carry you back on its own~",
  "怎么不动了呢？那我就当你想留下来啦♥": "Why so still? Then I'll take it you want to stay♥",
  "♥留下来♥": "♥Stay♥",
  "回来": "Come back",
  "不用数哦，我会帮你记着的~": "No need to count. I'll keep track for you~",
  "肩膀再放低一点吧~": "Lower your shoulders a little more~",
  "呼……吸……对，就是这样~": "Out... in... yes, just like that~",
  "听得见它滴答的声音吗？": "Can you hear it ticking?",
  "刚才在想什么呢？不用告诉我也可以哦~": "What were you thinking just now? You don't have to tell me~",
  "有念头冒出来的话，就让它飘走吧~": "If a thought floats up, just let it drift away~",
  "这里很暖和吧？": "It's warm in here, isn't it?",
  "眼睛累了的话，就看着怀表吧~": "If your eyes get tired, rest them on the watch~",
  "很好哦，就这样站着就可以了~": "Good. Just stand there, like that~",
  "不用那么紧张的哦~": "No need to be so tense~",
  "再靠近一点听我说话吧~": "Come a little closer and listen~",
  "照我说的做，是不是很舒服呀~": "Feels good to do as I say, doesn't it~",
  "真乖~": "Good boy~",
  "我一说『碰』，你就乖乖碰了呢~": "I said \"touch,\" and you touched it like a good boy~",
  "被我夸奖的时候，手会变快一点呢~": "Your hand speeds up a little when I praise you~",
  "不用自己拿主意，多轻松呀~": "Not having to decide. Isn't that easy~",
  "对，就是这样哦~": "Yes, that's it~",
  "我最喜欢听话的孩子了♥": "I just love obedient boys♥",
  "你已经在等我的下一句话了吧~": "You're already waiting for my next words, aren't you~",
  "『为什么』这种事，就不用再想了哦~": "You don't need to wonder \"why\" anymore~",
  "做得很好哦~ 还想再听我夸一次吗？": "Well done~ Want to hear me praise you again?",
  "你的手，现在是跟着我的声音在动哦~": "Your hand is moving to my voice now~",
  "越听话就会越舒服哦，要记住了~": "The more you obey, the better it feels. Remember that~",
  "刚才那是你的声音，还是我的声音呢~": "Was that your voice just now, or mine~",
  "你刚才想到的那句话，是我放进去的哦~": "That thought you just had? I put it there~",
  "你的眼睛，现在由我来保管哦~": "I'm keeping your eyes for you now~",
  "你会看见什么，由我来决定哦~": "I decide what you see~",
  "上面是上面，下面是下面……真的吗？": "Up is up, and down is down... is it really?",
  "念出来吧~ 念出来就会轻松很多哦。": "Read it out~ You'll feel so much lighter.",
  "『堕落』这个词，听起来很舒服吧~": "\"Fall\"... doesn't that word sound lovely~",
  "这些话你一直都想说吧？我知道的哦~": "You've always wanted to say these things. I know~",
  "其实是你自己想被我改掉的吧~": "The truth is, you wanted me to change you~",
  "原来的样子，已经记不清了吧？": "You can't remember how it used to be, can you?",
  "比起眼睛，相信我要轻松得多哦~": "Trusting me is so much easier than trusting your eyes~",
  "赢和输调换一下，也没什么关系吧~": "Swapping winning and losing... it hardly matters, does it~",
  "勇者大人已经输了哦~": "You've already lost, dear hero~",
  "又有一段时间不见了呢~": "Another stretch of time has slipped away~",
  "数字越来越大了哦？": "The numbers keep getting bigger, don't they?",
  "已经数不清过了多久了吧~": "You can't tell how long it's been anymore, can you~",
  "想不起来的时候，你一直很乖呢♥": "While you can't remember, you were such a good boy♥",
  "不用再撑了，反正已经输了嘛~": "You can stop trying. You've already lost, after all~",
  "就这样一直陪着我吧♥": "Just stay with me like this♥",
  "外面的事情，已经不重要了哦~": "Nothing out there matters anymore~",
  "把剩下的那一点也交给我吧~": "Give me that last little bit too~",
  "你的名字，我先帮你收着哦~": "I'll hold on to your name for you~",
  "真乖~ 再陷下去一点吧♥": "Good boy~ Sink a little deeper♥",
  "留下来的话，我会一直夸你的♥": "Stay, and I'll praise you forever♥",
  "越是想保持清醒，就陷得越快哦~": "The harder you try to stay awake, the faster you sink~",
  "我的声音，比你自己的想法还要近呢~": "My voice is closer to you than your own thoughts~",
  "听话是一件很舒服的事情哦~": "Obeying is such a pleasant thing~",
  "眼皮很重吧？那就垂下来吧~": "Heavy eyelids? Then let them fall~",
  "数到哪里了？忘掉也没关系哦~": "Where did you count to? It's fine to forget~",
  "什么都不用决定，多轻松呀~": "Nothing to decide. Isn't that easy~",
  "再靠近一点，我小声告诉你♥": "Come closer. I'll whisper it to you♥",
  "脑袋空空的也没关系，有我在呢~": "An empty head is fine. I'm right here~",
  "舒服吗？不用回答我也知道哦~": "Feel good? You don't have to answer. I can tell~",
  "剑握得这么紧，是舍不得放开吧~": "Gripping your sword so tight. You can't bear to let go, can you~",
  "这只怀表，是跟着我的心跳在走哦~": "This watch ticks in time with my heartbeat~",
  "你的呼吸，已经和我一样了呢~": "Your breathing matches mine now~",
  "现在的表情，只有我一个人看得到♥": "That face you're making is for my eyes only♥",
  "醒着的人，可不会这么乖哦~": "Someone who was awake wouldn't be this good~",
  "已经不想赢了吧？没关系的~": "You don't want to win anymore, do you? That's all right~",
  "就是这样~": "Just like that~",
  "不用回答哦": "No need to answer",
  "再慢一点~": "A little slower~",
  "嗯嗯~": "Mm-hm~",
  "我在看着哦": "I'm watching",
  "不着急~": "No rush~",
  "慢慢来~": "Take it slow~",
  "不用想": "Don't think",
  "别醒来": "Don't wake up",
  "不用想／不用想／不用想": "Don't think／Don't think／Don't think",
  "听她的／照她说的做／就好": "Listen to her／Do as she says／That's all",
  "左……／右……／左……": "Left...／Right...／Left...",
  "好安静／好近／好暖": "So quiet／So close／So warm",
  "讨伐／……讨伐谁？／算了": "Subjugate／...subjugate who?／Never mind",
  "只是一只表……": "It's just a watch...",
  "催眠术不存在": "Hypnosis isn't real",
  "我很清醒": "I'm wide awake",
  "她在拖时间……？": "Is she stalling...?",
  "只是碰一下而已": "It was just a touch",
  "这种把戏……": "A cheap trick...",
  "手还握着剑": "Sword's still in my hand",
  "有点……安静": "It's... quiet",
  "她的声音好近": "Her voice is so close",
  "我是来讨伐的": "I'm here to subjugate her",
  "为什么……照做了": "Why... did I obey",
  "被夸了……有点高兴": "She praised me... feels nice",
  "只是配合她一下": "Just humoring her",
  "下一句……是什么": "What's... the next line",
  "又数到零了……": "Counted to zero again...",
  "明知道不该碰": "I knew not to touch it",
  "她说『乖』的时候……": "When she says \"good boy\"...",
  "我没有在听她的": "I'm not obeying her",
  "好舒服……不对": "Feels good... no, wait",
  "那是……我的想法？": "Was that... my thought?",
  "我刚才念了什么": "What did I just read",
  "数字……变了？": "The numbers... changed?",
  "不对……哪里不对": "No... something's off",
  "想不起原来的样子": "Can't recall how it was",
  "念出来好舒服": "Feels good to say it",
  "她说的……是对的": "She's... right",
  "她的眼睛……好亮": "Her eyes... so bright",
  "我想……堕落……？": "I want... to fall...?",
  "眼睛不听话了": "My eyes won't obey",
  "我已经……输了？": "I already... lost?",
  "过去多久了……": "How long has it been...",
  "又少了一段……": "Another gap...",
  "数字……好大": "The number... so big",
  "数不清了……": "I've lost count...",
  "她的声音好暖": "Her voice is so warm",
  "还握着剑……": "Still holding my sword...",
  "不能……留下": "I can't... stay",
  "留下……也可以？": "Maybe... I could stay?",
  "想不起来了……": "I can't remember...",
  "我在……想什么": "What was I... thinking",
  "数到几了……": "What number was it...",
  "不想移开眼睛": "Don't want to look away",
  "好安静……": "So quiet...",
  "再听一句就好": "Just one more line",
  "为什么这么舒服": "Why does it feel so good",
  "我是来……讨伐……": "I came... to subjugate...",
  "眼皮……好重": "Eyelids... so heavy",
  "想照她说的做": "Want to do as she says",
  "脑子里是空的": "My head is empty",
  // 剧情（story-006.jsonc）
  "据点的门没有上锁。昏暗的屋子里只点着一盏灯，听得见怀表滴答滴答的声音。": "The hideout's door was unlocked. A single lamp lit the dim room, and you could hear a pocket watch ticking.",
  "是来讨伐我的勇者大人吧？我叫希普诺，请进~ 剑不用收起来哦，握着它也会安心一点吧。": "You must be the hero here to subjugate me. I'm Hypno. Come in~ No need to sheathe your sword. Holding it will put you at ease.",
  "你就是那个催眠术师吧。先说好，操纵人心的那种把戏，对我可不管用。": "So you're the hypnotist. Let me be clear: tricks for controlling people's minds won't work on me.",
  "把戏……呵呵，说得没错呢。催眠术这种东西，世界上根本就不存在嘛~": "Tricks... heh, you're quite right. There's no such thing as hypnosis in this world~",
  "……你自己承认了？": "...You admit it yourself?",
  "我可从来没有操纵过谁哦。留在这里的那些人，都是自己想留下来的呢。……不信的话，亲眼看一看也没关系吧？": "I've never controlled anyone. Everyone who stays here stays because they want to. ...If you doubt me, why not see for yourself?",
  "她抬起手，一只怀表从指间垂了下来，在长长的链子下面慢慢地摆着。": "She raised her hand. A pocket watch slipped from between her fingers and swung slowly on its long chain.",
  "只是一只普通的怀表而已~ 不用一直盯着它，让眼睛有个地方放就好。左……右……": "It's just an ordinary pocket watch~ You don't have to stare. Just give your eyes somewhere to rest. Left... right...",
  "你现在站在我面前，手里握着剑，耳朵里听得见它滴答滴答地在走……对不对？": "You're standing in front of me, sword in hand, and you can hear it ticking away... isn't that right?",
  "……那又怎么样。": "...So what.",
  "不怎么样呀~ 只是你每在心里答一声『对』，肩膀就会放松一点点……你看，又松下来了呢。": "Oh, nothing~ It's just that every time you answer \"yes\" in your head, your shoulders loosen a little... see, there they go again.",
  "呼吸也是哦。刚进门的时候还那么急，现在已经和它摆得一样慢了呢。": "Your breathing too. It was so quick when you walked in, and now it's as slow as the swing of the watch.",
  "滴……答……": "Tick... tock...",
  "（……只是因为走了很远的路，有点累了而已。）": "(...I walked a long way. I'm a little tired, that's all.)",
  "站得那么远，听不清我说话吧？再靠近一点也可以哦~ 放心，我不会碰你的。": "You can't hear me well from way over there, can you? Come closer if you like~ Don't worry, I won't touch you.",
  "是你自己想靠过来的哦♥": "You're the one who wanted to come closer♥",
  "眼皮觉得重的话，垂下来一点也没关系的。看不清怀表了，就听着我的声音吧~": "If your eyelids feel heavy, let them droop a little. When you can't see the watch, just listen to my voice~",
  "对了，能帮我一个小忙吗？数一数它摆了多少下，在心里默默地数就好~": "Oh, would you do me a small favor? Count how many times it swings. Silently, in your head~",
  "（一、二、三……六、七……七……咦，刚才那一下，数过了吗？）": "(One, two, three... six, seven... seven... wait, did I count that last one?)",
  "数乱了吗？呵呵……那是因为你在从小往大数哦。数字越数越多，脑袋当然会乱掉嘛~": "Lost count? Heh... that's because you're counting up. The numbers keep growing, so of course your head gets muddled~",
  "从大往小数的话，就不会出错了哦。我来示范一次给你看~ 要好好听着……": "Count down from the top and you'll never slip. Let me show you once~ Listen closely...",
  "三……肩膀放松下来~": "Three... your shoulders relax~",
  "二……呼吸变得更慢了……": "Two... your breathing slows even more...",
  "一……脑袋里什么都不用想了……": "One... nothing left to think about...",
  "零♥": "Zero♥",
  "啪~ 你看，一下都没有数错吧？而且什么事都没有发生哦，你还好好地站着，剑也还握在手里呢。": "Snap~ See? Not a single miscount. And nothing happened. You're still standing, sword still in hand.",
  "……哼。我早就说过了，这种东西对我没用。": "...Hmph. I told you. That sort of thing doesn't work on me.",
  "嗯嗯，一点用都没有呢~ 那就开始吧，勇者大人。让我好好见识一下你的『讨伐』♥": "Mm-hm, it didn't work at all~ Then let's begin, dear hero. Show me this \"subjugation\" of yours♥",
  "真是个好孩子♥": "Such a good boy♥",
  "怀表的声音停了下来，屋子里一下子变得很安静。": "The ticking stopped, and the room fell suddenly quiet.",
  "……居然连最后的十五秒都忍住了呢。能把三组全部撑下来的，勇者大人还是第一个哦。": "...You even held out through those last fifteen seconds. You're the first to last all three sets, dear hero.",
  "哈啊……我早就说过了吧。催眠术这种东西……根本就不存在。": "Hah... I told you. Hypnosis... doesn't exist.",
  "嗯，是不存在呢……这一次是我输了~": "Mm, it doesn't... I lose this time~",
  "输了就是输了呢~ 来吧，勇者大人，只要给我最后一击，就可以回去领赏了哦？": "A loss is a loss~ Go on, dear hero. One finishing blow and you can head home for your reward, you know?",
  "饶过催眠术师": "Spare the hypnotist",
  "啪~ ……哎呀，勇者大人的手，怎么自己停下来了呢？♥": "Snap~ ...Oh my, why did your hand stop all by itself, dear hero?♥",
  "（手……自己动了？我刚才……到底选了什么……？）": "(My hand... moved on its own? What did I... just choose...?)",
  "其实从我数到零的那一刻开始，勇者大人就一次都没有醒过来哦~": "The truth is, from the moment I counted to zero, you never woke up even once~",
  "刚才那三场『讨伐』，都是我陪你做的梦哦。你撑得越用力就陷得越深……所以我才一直让你赢的呀♥": "Those three \"subjugations\" were a dream I shared with you. The harder you held out, the deeper you sank... that's why I kept letting you win♥",
  "（不对……我明明……全都撑过来了才对……）": "(No... I held out... through all of it...)",
  "是呀，撑得非常漂亮呢~ 不过很可惜，美梦已经做完了哦。": "Yes, and so beautifully~ But I'm afraid the sweet dream is over now.",
  "接下来就没有『第几组』，也没有倒数了。勇者大人就一直留在这里陪着我吧~": "From here on, there are no \"sets\" and no countdown. You'll stay right here with me, dear hero~",
  "没有……倒数了？": "No... countdown?",
  "螺旋慢慢停了下来。屋子里只剩下一盏灯，和一只不再摆动的怀表。": "The spiral slowed to a stop. All that remained in the room was a single lamp and a pocket watch that no longer swung.",
  "……骗人的吧？陷得那么深，居然靠自己走出来了……": "...You can't be serious. You were that deep, and you walked out on your own...",
  "哈啊……哈啊……原来催眠术……是真的存在的啊……": "Hah... hah... so hypnosis... really does exist...",
  "呵呵……是存在的哦。只不过，好像对勇者大人不管用呢~": "Heh... it does. It just doesn't seem to work on you, dear hero~",
  "哎呀？好不容易才走出去，结果又自己走回来了吗~": "Oh? You finally got out, and now you've walked right back in~",
  "这一次我可是什么都没有说哦？是勇者大人自己开口求我的呢♥": "I didn't say a word this time, you know? You're the one who asked me, dear hero♥",
  "怀表又一次慢慢地摆了起来——这一回，是真的没有尽头了。": "The pocket watch began to swing once more—and this time, there truly was no end.",
  "还是不相信吗？": "Still don't believe?",
  "这一次是我彻底输了呢~ 那么，勇者大人打算怎么处置我呢？这次可没有人会替你选了哦。": "This time I've lost completely~ So, what will you do with me, dear hero? No one will choose for you this time.",
  "请再催眠我一次": "Please hypnotize me again",
  // 委托单、定时演出、文字顺序题的句子、奖杯（quest-006.jsonc）
  "市民甲": "Citizen A",
  "希普诺": "Hypno",
  "动手之前，先喘口气也可以哦~": "Before you strike, feel free to catch your breath~",
  "眼睛不知道该看哪里的话，就看着它吧~": "If you don't know where to look, look at this~",
  "点击怀表上的按钮": "Tap the watch button",
  "刚才碰它的时候，你一点都没有犹豫呢~": "You didn't hesitate at all when you touched it just now~",
  "有什么东西在涨？不用在意哦，看着怀表就好~": "Something's going up? Pay it no mind. Just look at the watch~",
  "只是碰一下表而已": "I only touched the watch",
  "再来一次吧~ 你已经在等我开口了，对不对？": "Once more~ You're already waiting for me to speak, aren't you?",
  "还记得吗？从大往小数，就不会出错哦~": "Remember? Count down from the top and you won't slip~",
  "这一颗碰了可是会头晕的哦？我先告诉你了~": "Touch this one and you'll get dizzy, you know? I've warned you~",
  "又来一颗哦~ 这一次你会怎么做呢？": "Here's another~ What will you do this time?",
  "这一次不用看怀表了哦，看着我就好~": "No need to look at the watch this time. Just look at me~",
  "我想堕落": "I|want|to|fall",
  "请您支配我": "Take|over|my|mind",
  "不想思考了": "No|need|to|think",
  "勇者大人一直很想赢吧？办法就写在你手边哦~": "You've wanted to win all along, right? The way is written by your hand~",
  "长按获胜": "Hold to win",
  "获胜": "Win",
  "我是催眠奴隶": "I|am|your|hypno|slave",
  "我自愿服从您": "I|gladly|obey|you",
  "数到零了哦？奇怪，怎么还没有赢呢~": "It's reached zero, hasn't it? Strange. Why haven't you won yet~",
  "数到零了……为什么": "It hit zero... so why",
  "按下去吧♥": "Press it♥",
  "不按的话，就会一直停在零哦？我倒是不介意~": "If you don't press, we'll stay at zero forever. I don't mind~",
  "按住它吧~ 按到底，你就『赢』了哦♥": "Hold it down~ All the way, and you \"win\"♥",
  "按下去……就赢了……？": "Press it... and I win...?",
  "你已经输了哟~": "You've already lost~",
  "不知不觉就已经错过了获胜的机会了~": "Before you knew it, your chance to win had already slipped away~",
  "已经……输了……？": "I already... lost...?",
  "不知不觉已经过去四十多秒了哦，你都没发现呢~": "Over forty seconds have gone by without you noticing~",
  "明明才数到十二……": "I was only at twelve...",
  "哪一只才是真的呢~": "Which one is real, I wonder~",
  "按住怀表，跟着它摆": "Hold the watch and follow it",
  "咦，又有一分钟不见了呢~ 是不是越数越乱了？": "Oh, another minute gone~ The more you count, the more lost you get, hm?",
  "已经过去好几分钟了哦~ 这次也别跟丢了♥": "Several minutes have passed now~ Don't lose it this time either♥",
  "对了，最后再告诉勇者大人一件事吧~": "Oh, one last thing I'll tell you, dear hero~",
  "顺着螺旋往外走的话，其实是可以醒过来的哦。": "Follow the spiral outward, and you can actually wake up.",
  "往外走……就能醒": "Walk outward... and wake",
  "不过……勇者大人真的走得出去吗？♥": "But... can you really make it out, dear hero?♥",
  "醒来": "Wake",
  "催眠术对我没用": "Hypnosis-Proof",
  "从希普诺的螺旋里自己走出来，完成讨伐·催眠术师": "Walk out of Hypno's spiral on your own and complete Subjugation · Hypnotist",

  // ================= 002 · 按角色另加的言责（quest-002.jsonc 的 speech.add） =================
  "不愧是人家看中的哥哥": "That's the guy I picked",
  "忍着的样子好可爱": "You're cute when you hold it in",
  "人家最喜欢听话的哥哥了": "I love it when you do as I say",
  "对，再让人家多看一点": "Yes, let me see more",
  "输给人家又不丢人": "Losing to me is nothing to be ashamed of",
  "人家准你输哦": "I'll allow you to lose",
  "输掉的事也替哥哥保密": "I'll keep your loss a secret too",
  "在这里出来，谁也不会知道": "Let it out right here, no one will ever know",
  "就为人家输一次嘛": "Lose just once, for me",
  "哥哥好逊哦": "You're so lame",
  "这样也算冒险者吗": "And you call yourself an adventurer",
  "脸都红透了啦": "Your face is bright red",
  "嘴上说讨伐，手倒很老实": "All that talk of subjugation, but your hand's so honest",
  "哥哥真的好好骗": "You're so easy to fool",

  // ================= 003 · 按角色另加的言责（quest-003.jsonc 的 speech.add） =================
  "真是虔诚的孩子": "Such a devout child",
  "祷告得很认真呢": "You're praying so earnestly",
  "忍耐的表情很美哦": "You look beautiful when you endure",
  "好孩子，继续祈祷": "Good child, keep praying",
  "你的痛苦我都看着呢": "I'm watching all of your suffering",
  "这么乖，神也会嫉妒的": "So obedient, even God would be jealous",
  "认输也是一种忏悔": "Surrender is a kind of repentance too",
  "我会赦免你的": "I will absolve you",
  "全部告解出来吧": "Confess it all",
  "向我祈祷就好": "Just pray to me",
  "0就在我这里哦": "The 0 is right here with me",
  "输掉也会被宽恕的": "Even losing will be forgiven",
  "跪下来就轻松了": "Kneel and it all gets easier",
  "让我替你数完吧": "Let me finish counting for you",
  "真是罪孽深重呢": "How deeply sinful you are",
  "连祷告都不专心": "You can't even focus on your prayer",
  "迷途的小羊": "Little lost lamb",
  "欲望都写在脸上了": "Your desire is written all over your face",
  "又在心里求我了吧": "You begged me in your heart again, didn't you",
  "神都移开视线了哦": "Even God is looking away",

  // ================= 委托 007 · 讨伐·公会柜台（莉薇尔；2026-10-19）=================
  // 委托单、提示条、定时演出、奖杯、冒险者卡的称号和名字（quest-007.jsonc）
  "想要最终通过的话，要坚持自己的意志不放松": "To make it through in the end, hold on to your will and don't let go",
  "莉薇尔": "Liviel",
  "认为自己可以前往下一组时，可以长按通过": "When you feel ready for the next set, long-press to clear it",
  "握紧~♥": "Squeeze~♥",
  "只是模拟战哦~ 放轻松，跟着姐姐的节奏来♥": "Just a mock battle~ Relax and follow my rhythm♥",
  "不许离开，让姐姐吸一下": "Don't leave. Let me drain you",
  "认真的样子……姐姐很喜欢哦♥": "That serious look... I like it♥",
  "让姐姐凑近一点看看你，好不好？": "Let me take a closer look at you, okay?",
  "这几级，姐姐吸走咯~ 啾♥": "I'll drain these levels~ Mwah♥",
  "想让姐姐摸一摸吗？": "Want me to touch you?",
  "那就……一点一点地摸走哦♥": "Then... I'll stroke them away bit by bit♥",
  "最后……要不要姐姐亲一下？": "Last one... want a kiss from me?",
  "这一口，要你四级哦♥": "This sip costs you four levels♥",
  "等一下~ 还没吸够呢♥": "Wait~ I haven't drained enough♥",
  "要保护好自己的冒险者卡片，不可以被踩脏喔~": "Protect your adventurer card. Don't let it get stepped on~",
  "跪下来吧，从下面往上看着姐姐~": "Kneel, and look up at me from below~",
  "再交一点点吧？姐姐会好好疼你的~": "Just a little more? I'll spoil you rotten~",
  "乖~ 眼睛只看着姐姐吧♥": "Good boy~ Keep your eyes only on me♥",
  "眼睛……只许看着姐姐哦♥": "Your eyes... are only allowed on me♥",
  "嘘……看着姐姐就好♥": "Shh... just look at me♥",
  "全部……都是姐姐的了♥": "All of it... is mine now♥",
  "最后一口……姐姐收下了哦♥": "One last sip... and it's mine♥",
  "我的等级由我保护": "My Levels, My Guard",
  "一级等级都没有被吸走，完成讨伐·公会柜台": "Complete Subjugation · Guild Counter without losing a single level",
  "新人冒险者": "Rookie Adventurer",
  "弱小冒险者": "Weakling Adventurer",
  "柜台的常客": "Counter Regular",
  "莉薇尔的储蓄罐": "Liviel's Piggy Bank",
  "自愿上供的杂鱼": "Tribute Small Fry",
  "被吸到上瘾": "Drain Addict",
  "变态败北癖": "Defeat Fetishist",
  "等级罐子预备役": "Level Jar Trainee",
  "收藏预定品": "Future Collectible",
  "M奴隶·{name}": "M-Slave {name}",
  "等级罐子 No.{no}": "Level Jar No.{no}",
  // 剧情（story-007.jsonc）
  "又来登记了呀~ 这已经是第{n}次了哦♥": "Back to register again~? That's the {n}th time now♥",
  "看你一次又一次地回来……姐姐也有点心软了呢~": "Watching you come back again and again... I'm going a little soft~",
  "只要承认自己是『姐姐的储蓄罐』，就让你从输掉的那一组重新开始哦♥": "Admit you're my \"piggy bank,\" and I'll let you start over from the set you lost♥",
  "怎么样？承认自己是乖乖给姐姐存等级的储蓄罐吗~♥": "So? Will you admit you're a good little piggy bank saving up levels for me~?♥",
  "承认自己是储蓄罐": "Admit I'm a piggy bank",
  "才不是储蓄罐": "I'm no piggy bank",
  "好乖~♥ 那从今天起，{name}就是姐姐专属的储蓄罐了哦": "Good boy~♥ From today on, {name}, you're my very own piggy bank",
  "解锁了「重来这一组」：之后彻底败北时，可以从输掉的那一组重新开始（等级回到那一组开始的时候）": "Unlocked \"Retry this set\": after a total defeat, you can start over from the set you lost (your level returns to where it was at the start of that set)",
  "嘴硬的样子也很可爱呢~ 那就从模拟战重新来吧♥": "Even your stubborn side is cute~ Then let's start over from the mock battle♥",
  "大厅的灯熄了一半，只剩新人登记的柜台还亮着。据说那些退会的新人，都是从这里开始的。": "Half the lights in the hall were out; only the new-member registration counter still glowed. They say every newcomer who quit the guild started right here.",
  "这么晚了还有新人来登记呀？……真乖，姐姐正好还没下班哦~": "A newcomer registering this late? ...How sweet. Lucky for you, I haven't clocked out yet~",
  "柜台后面坐着一个黑皮肤的精灵。她撑着下巴往前倾，衬衫的扣子绷得紧紧的，像是随时都会弹开。": "Behind the counter sat a dark-skinned elf. She leaned forward, chin in hand, the buttons of her blouse straining as if they might pop at any moment.",
  "收得细细的腰，绷紧的短裙，还有被白丝勒出一圈软肉的大腿——视线不知不觉，就一路滑了下去。": "A slender, cinched waist, a tight skirt, thighs soft where the white stockings bit in—before you knew it, your gaze had slid all the way down.",
  "看够了吗？": "Seen enough?",
  "比起盯着姐姐看，还是先来制作冒险者卡片吧~": "Instead of staring at me, how about we make your adventurer card first~",
  "把名字告诉姐姐吧。没关系的，个人隐私并不会录入系统~ 为了体验感，这边很推荐用真名喔~": "Tell me your name. Don't worry, no personal info goes into the system~ For the full experience, I recommend your real name~",
  "{name}是么……嗯，很好听呢。姐姐会好好记住的♥": "{name}, is it... Mm, what a lovely name. I'll be sure to remember it♥",
  "咦，卡上浮出来的等级是……30？刚来登记的新人，可不会有这么高的等级~": "Oh? The level showing on your card is... 30? A brand-new registrant shouldn't be this high~",
  "（糟了……）以、以前在乡下打过几只史莱姆而已。": "(Crap...) I-I just beat a few slimes back home in the countryside, that's all.",
  "呵呵，那就当作是这样吧。反正在姐姐这里登记过的乖孩子，最后都会变回真正的新人呢♥": "Heh, let's go with that. Every good boy who registers with me ends up a real newcomer in the end anyway♥",
  "我是新人登记处的莉薇尔。首先，让我们先来进行一个模拟战，来测试一下{name}的实力吧~": "I'm Liviel of the new-member registration desk. First, let's have a mock battle to test what you've got, {name}~",
  "最后一组也结束了。你大口喘着气，等级还剩下不少。": "The last set was over. You gasped for breath—but plenty of your levels remained.",
  "……居然一直撑到了最后。明明是个新人，倒是比谁都能忍呢~": "...You actually held out to the very end. For a newcomer, you're more patient than anyone~",
  "那些等级下降、退出公会的新人……都是你做的吧。": "All those newcomers who lost levels and quit the guild... that was you, wasn't it.",
  "被发现了呀~ 原来是 Aschan 派来的……那么，打算怎么处置姐姐呢？": "Caught me~ So Aschan sent you... Well then, what do you plan to do with me?",
  "要把姐姐交给公会吗？还是说……{name}愿意替姐姐保守这个秘密呢？♥": "Will you hand me over to the guild? Or... will you keep my secret, {name}?♥",
  "把她交给公会": "Hand her over to the guild",
  "包庇她": "Cover for her",
  "……要包庇姐姐？呵呵，{name}果然是个温柔的孩子呢♥": "...You'll cover for me? Heh, you really are a sweet boy, {name}♥",
  "那报告就拜托你了哦~ 作为谢礼，剩下的等级……姐姐会好好收下的♥": "Then I'll leave the report to you~ And as thanks, the rest of your levels... I'll be sure to take them♥",
  "你在交给 Aschan 的报告上写下了「未发现异常」。从那天起，新人登记处的柜台前多了一个常客。": "On the report for Aschan, you wrote \"Nothing unusual found.\" From that day on, the new-member registration counter had one more regular.",
  "冒险者卡上的数字停在了 0。莉薇尔捏着那张卡，推开了柜台后面的那扇门。": "The number on the adventurer card stopped at 0. Pinching the card between her fingers, Liviel pushed open the door behind the counter.",
  "这里就是姐姐的收藏柜哦~ 架子上的每一张，都是被吸得干干净净的新人呢♥": "This is my collection~ Every card on these shelves is a newcomer drained completely dry♥",
  "（手指……动不了。连站起来的力气都没有了……）": "(My fingers... won't move. I can't even stand...)",
  "{name}的这一张，就放在最显眼的地方吧♥": "Yours, {name}, goes right where everyone can see it♥",
  "明天再来公会吧~ 姐姐会帮你做一张新的卡——从 Lv1 开始哦♥": "Come back to the guild tomorrow~ I'll make you a new card—starting from Lv1♥",
  "那之后，公会的退会名单上又多了一个名字。Aschan 交代的那份调查报告，再也没有人交上去。": "After that, one more name was added to the guild's list of dropouts. The investigation report Aschan asked for was never turned in.",
  "还要继续吗？": "Keep going?",
  // 台词（lines-007.jsonc）
  "新人呀？别紧张，姐姐会好好照顾你的~": "A newcomer? Relax, I'll take good care of you~",
  "这么晚还来公会……是想见姐姐吗？♥": "Coming to the guild this late... did you want to see me?♥",
  "准备好了吗？姐姐可要开始了哦~": "Ready? I'm about to start~",
  "模拟战开始咯~ 让姐姐看看{name}的实力吧♥": "The mock battle begins~ Show me what you've got, {name}♥",
  "嗯~？怎么感觉{name}很认真的样子~？": "Hmm~? Why do you look so serious, {name}~?",
  "这么认真的话，姐姐也不陪你玩了哦~ 跪到这里来吧♥": "If you're this serious, playtime's over~ Kneel right here♥",
  "最后一组了呢~ 剩下的那些，姐姐全部都要了哦♥": "Last set~ Whatever's left, I'm taking all of it♥",
  "模拟战合格了哦~ 想多待一会儿的话，就用等级来换吧♥": "You passed the mock battle~ Want to stay a little longer? Pay me in levels♥",
  "想走的话随时都可以走……姐姐不会拉住你的♥": "You can leave whenever you like... I won't stop you♥",
  "那就……开始吸咯♥": "Then... I'll start draining♥",
  "乖，那姐姐就不客气了哦~": "Good boy. Then I won't hold back~",
  "留下来了呢♥ 那就一口一口来吧~": "You stayed♥ Then let's take it one sip at a time~",
  "还不走呀？那姐姐就……开始吸咯♥": "Still not leaving? Then I'll... start draining♥",
  "这么认真的人，原来也会舍不得走呢~♥": "Even someone this serious can't bring himself to leave~♥",
  "不起来呀~ 那姐姐就踩下去咯♥": "Not getting up~? Then down comes my heel♥",
  "还跪着呢……真乖，那就再让姐姐踩一会儿吧♥": "Still kneeling... such a good boy. Let me step on you a little longer♥",
  "最后一组也撑过来了呢……剩下的，就交给姐姐吧♥": "You made it through the last set too... Leave the rest to me♥",
  "撑了这么久，累了吧？躺进姐姐怀里，什么都不用想了哦~": "You held on so long—tired? Rest in my arms. No need to think anymore~",
  "又吸走一级了哦~ 现在是 Lv{lv} 呢♥": "Another level drained~ You're Lv{lv} now♥",
  "别紧张，被吸的时候，只要乖乖看着姐姐就好~": "Relax. While I drain you, just keep your eyes on me~",
  "Lv{lv}……嗯，越来越像真正的新人了呢♥": "Lv{lv}... Mm, you're looking more like a real newcomer♥",
  "身体是不是轻飘飘的？那是等级在往姐姐这边流哦~": "Feeling light and floaty? That's your levels flowing over to me~",
  "刚才那么认真，现在却舍不得走了呢~♥": "So serious a moment ago, and now you can't bear to leave~♥",
  "Lv{lv}了哦~ 真的不走吗？": "Lv{lv} now~ Sure you're not leaving?",
  "再靠过来一点……对，就这样，一级一级交给姐姐♥": "Come a little closer... yes, just like that. Hand me your levels one by one♥",
  "又踩掉一级~ Lv{lv}，自己数清楚了吗？♥": "Stomped off another level~ Lv{lv}. Are you keeping count?♥",
  "被鞋跟踩着还不肯起来……{name}真是乖得让人心疼呢~": "Pinned under my heel and still not getting up... You're so good it almost hurts, {name}~",
  "抬头看着姐姐哦，被吸走的时候，要好好记住这张脸♥": "Look up at me. Remember this face while your levels drain away♥",
  "只剩 Lv{lv} 了哦~ 再待一会儿，就什么都不剩了呢♥": "Only Lv{lv} left~ Stay a bit longer and there'll be nothing at all♥",
  "明明是来讨伐姐姐的……现在却连站起来的力气都没有了呢~": "You came to subjugate me... and now you can't even stand~",
  "这么舍不得走……那就全部交给姐姐吧♥": "If you can't bear to leave... then give me everything♥",
  "要走了吗？刚才明明还看得那么入迷呢~": "Leaving? You were staring so intently a moment ago~",
  "手指在用力了哦……真的舍得走吗？♥": "Your finger's pressing down... can you really bring yourself to go?♥",
  "嗯~ 按吧，姐姐就在这里看着你按哦♥": "Mm~ Go ahead and press. I'll watch you do it♥",
  "松开了呢♥ 那就再吸一级哦~": "You let go♥ Then I'll drain one more level~",
  "果然还是想留下来吧~ 姐姐都知道的♥": "You want to stay after all~ I know♥",
  "乖孩子~ 那我们继续哦♥": "Good boy~ Let's keep going♥",
  "想站起来？姐姐的鞋跟还没踩够呢~": "Trying to stand? My heel hasn't had enough yet~",
  "腿都软了吧？还按得动吗♥": "Legs gone weak? Can you still press?♥",
  "松开了~ 那就乖乖跪回去哦♥": "You let go~ Now kneel back down like a good boy♥",
  "嗯，这才对嘛~ 继续踩咯♥": "Mm, that's more like it~ I'll keep stepping♥",
  "等一下~ 姐姐还没吸够呢♥": "Wait~ I haven't drained enough yet♥",
  "这么急着走？再看姐姐一眼嘛~": "In such a hurry? Look at me just once more~",
  "谁准你站起来了？乖乖跪回去~♥": "Who said you could stand? Kneel back down~♥",
  "腿还在抖呢……再跪一会儿吧♥": "Your legs are still shaking... kneel a little longer♥",
  "别走嘛~ 姐姐还想再抱一会儿♥": "Don't go~ I want to hold you a little longer♥",
  "真的要丢下姐姐吗……？♥": "You're really leaving me behind...?♥",
  "最后一口……让姐姐吸完再走嘛~♥": "One last sip... let me finish before you go~♥",
  "放轻松~ 只是模拟战而已，姐姐不会欺负新人的哦。": "Relax~ It's just a mock battle. I don't bully newcomers.",
  "握紧……松开……嗯，就是这个节奏，跟着姐姐哦~": "Squeeze... release... yes, that rhythm. Follow my lead~",
  "手心已经出汗了呢，是因为紧张，还是因为姐姐？": "Your palms are already sweaty. Is it nerves, or is it me?",
  "嗯~ 新人能撑到这里，已经很不错了哦~": "Mm~ Lasting this long as a newcomer is pretty impressive~",
  "{name}，眼睛不可以一直往下看哦♥": "{name}, no staring down there the whole time♥",
  "再用力一点也没关系，姐姐受得住的~": "You can squeeze harder. I can take it~",
  "快结束了哦~ 再坚持一下，就算你合格♥": "Almost done~ Hang on a little more and you pass♥",
  "握得这么用力……其实是不想这么快结束吧？": "Squeezing so hard... you don't actually want it to end so soon, do you?",
  "呼吸乱了呢~ 模拟战而已，有这么累吗？": "Your breathing's ragged~ Is a mock battle really that tiring?",
  "第一招来咯~ 看准了再点哦♥": "Here comes the first move~ Aim before you tap♥",
  "按住~ 让姐姐看看，{name}能撑多久呢♥": "Hold it~ Let me see how long you can last, {name}♥",
  "应该不会，是真的准备『讨伐』姐姐吧？": "You're not actually here to \"subjugate\" me, are you?",
  "这么认真的表情……姐姐有点期待了呢~": "Such a serious face... I'm starting to look forward to this~",
  "那就让姐姐看看，你能认真到什么时候吧♥": "Then let's see how long you can stay serious♥",
  "想看得更清楚吗？那就要拿一点等级来换哦~": "Want a better look? That'll cost you a few levels~",
  "说是来讨伐的，眼睛却一直离不开姐姐呢♥": "You say you came to subjugate me, yet your eyes won't leave me♥",
  "认真的孩子，被诱惑的时候也特别可爱呢~": "Serious boys are extra cute when they're being tempted~",
  "再撑一下就结束了~ 撑完之后，还要不要留下来呢？♥": "Just a little more~ And once it's over, will you stay?♥",
  "呼吸这么乱……刚才的气势去哪里了？": "Breathing this hard... where did all that spirit go?",
  "讨伐姐姐之前，先别被姐姐迷住哦~": "Before you subjugate me, try not to fall for me~",
  "把你的卡……沿着这里，送到姐姐胸口来~♥": "Your card... slide it along here, right to my chest~♥",
  "嗯……夹好了哦。贴着姐姐的心跳，很暖和吧~♥": "Mm... it's nestled in. Warm against my heartbeat, isn't it~♥",
