  "新客人？我的牌桌今晚还空着一个位子……就留给你哦♥": "A new face? There's one seat left at my table tonight... it's yours♥",
  "想赢我？先把筹码和眼睛都押上来吧~": "Want to beat me? Then put your chips—and your eyes—on the table~",
