  "这半个月，常客们一个接一个被掏空了钱包。问他们输给了谁，全都红着脸说不出口w": "For two weeks, regulars keep getting cleaned out. Ask who beat them, and they just turn red lol",
  "……到底是输给了谁？": "...So who beat them?",
  "一个叫「J」的舞娘。一边扭着腰一边发牌，从来没输过——Aschan 猜，她在牌上动了手脚。": "A dancer named \"J.\" Sways her hips as she deals, never loses—Aschan bets she's rigging the cards.",
  "所以，把 Aschan 的护符借给你。戴着它，她那些小魔法就一个都使不出来了。": "So Aschan's lending you her charm. Wear it, and none of her little spells will work.",
  "只要有这个护符在，就可以保证游戏是在系统上『绝对公平』的状态下进行的。明白了吗？": "With this charm on you, the system guarantees the game stays 『absolutely fair』. Got it?",
  "护符上还镶着四枚魔力碎片。想牌的时候点一下护符，手牌就多算 1 点——用完就没了，要省着点用w": "It holds four mana shards: tap it on your turn for +1 to your hand. Use them sparingly lol",
  "很贵的哦，弄丢了就拿你自己来赔~ 还有，不许被那种女人勾走，听到没有？♥": "It's pricey—lose it and you'll pay with yourself~ And don't fall for women like her, hear me?♥",
  "对了……你会玩 21 点吗？": "Oh, right... do you know how to play blackjack?",
  "会，直接出发": "Yes, I'll head out",
  "不太会，教教我": "Not really, teach me",
  "那就去吧~ 早点回来，Aschan 等着听你是怎么赢的哦w": "Off you go then~ Come back soon. Aschan wants to hear how you won lol",
  "赌场藏在酒窖底下。门一推开，鼓点、甜腻的烟和筹码的碰撞声一起涌上来，像一只热乎乎的手，把你往里拽。": "The door below the wine cellar opens: drums, sweet smoke, clinking chips—a warm hand tugging you in.",
  "人群围着的牌桌中央，一道黑纱随着鼓点起落。她裸露的腰肢每扭一下，周围就响起一片口哨声。": "Amid the crowd, a black veil flutters to the drums. Each sway of her bare waist draws whistles.",
  "新来的客人？……别站在门口嘛，过来坐。我是这张桌子的荷官，叫我 J 就好♥": "New here? ...Don't hover at the door, come sit. I'm this table's dealer—just call me J♥",
  "（就是她……）我要玩 21 点。": "(That's her...) I'll play blackjack.",
  "好呀~ 来，坐近一点……第一张牌，先看牌，再看我哦♥": "Lovely~ Come sit closer... First card: eyes on the card, then on me♥",
  "真拿你没办法~ 你和荷官各拿两张牌，谁更接近 21 谁赢；超过 21 叫「爆牌」，直接输掉。": "Geez~ You and the dealer get two cards each. Closest to 21 wins; over 21 is a \"Bust\"—you lose.",
  "2 到 10 照牌面算，J、Q、K 都是 10。A 最贴心了，算 1 还是 11，随你挑。": "2 to 10 count as shown; J, Q and K are all 10. Aces are the sweetest: 1 or 11, your pick.",
  "嫌少就「要牌」再拿一张，够了就「停牌」。别贪心哦，贪心的人最容易被撑爆w": "Too low? \"Hit\" for another card. Enough? \"Stand.\" Don't get greedy—greedy boys bust fastest lol",
  "荷官有一张扣着的暗牌，等你停牌才翻开，然后一直拿，拿到 17 点以上才肯停手。": "The dealer's hole card flips once you stand; then she keeps drawing until she has 17 or more.",
  "开局两张就是 A 加 10 点牌的，叫「天生 21 点」，最大。一样大就算平局。": "An Ace plus a 10-value card on the deal is a \"Blackjack\"—the best hand. A tie is a push.",
  "剩下的到了牌桌上会有提示~ 最要紧的一条：她的腰再好看，也要先看牌，知道吗？": "The table will show you the rest~ Most important: however nice her waist is, cards first. Got it?",
  "最后一张牌翻开，她的点数停在了你的下面。她扭动的腰肢停了下来，再也没跟上鼓点。": "The last card flips. Her total lands beneath yours. Her hips go still and lose the beat.",
  "……居然真的赢到了最后。客人，你比看上去难缠多了呢~": "...You actually won to the very end. You're a lot tougher than you look, darling~",
  "酒场那些输光的人……全是被你用魔法骗的吧。": "Everyone from the tavern who lost it all... you cheated them with magic, didn't you.",
  "被发现了呀~ 那么，打算怎么处置我呢？绑起来交差，还是……带回去慢慢审？♥": "Caught me~ So what now? Tie me up and turn me in, or... take me home for a slow interrogation?♥",
  "要把我交给公会吗？还是说……再陪我赌最后一局？♥": "Will you hand me to the Guild? Or... play one last game with me?♥",
  "再赌一局": "One more game",
  "呵呵……果然是个赌徒呢~ 护符你就戴着吧，我照样赢你。": "Heh... you really are a gambler~ Keep the charm on, darling. I'll still win.",
  "这一局不分桌、不算手数，赌到你撑不住为止……我会一直跳给你一个人看♥": "No tables, no hand count. We play till you can't hold out... and I'll dance only for you♥",
  "她把牌重新洗好，指尖从你手背上慢慢划过，又踩着鼓点跳了起来。": "She reshuffles, slowly trails a fingertip across your hand, and dances to the drums once more.",
  "继续赌局": "Keep gambling",
  "神秘荷官J": "Mysterious Dealer J",
  "特殊规则：倒计时不算，胜场数达到要求才算通过": "Special rule: the countdown doesn't count—win enough hands to clear",
  "感觉她要换牌时，记得点一下发金光的牌": "When she's about to swap a card, tap the one glowing gold",
  "一直盯着我呢": "Staring at me...",
  "比它暖和哦♥": "Warmer than it♥",
  "今晚，你归我了♥": "Mine tonight♥",
  "全身而退": "Walked Away Clean",
  "整局罚时加起来不超过 50 秒，完成讨伐·赌场舞娘": "Complete Subjugation · Casino Dancer with no more than 50 sec of total penalty",
  "庄家克星": "Bane of the House",
  "不用魔力碎片、一手都没输，完成讨伐·赌场舞娘": "Complete Subjugation · Casino Dancer without using a mana shard or losing a single hand",
  "要牌": "Hit",
  "停牌": "Stand",
