  "破法！": "Dispelled!",
  "魔力碎片：点护符，这一手点数 +1（还剩 {n} 枚）": "Mana shard: tap the charm for +1 this hand ({n} left)",
  "护符交出去了": "Charm given up",
  "荷官小姐可以随便用魔法了": "The dealer can use magic freely now",
  "护符留在身上": "Charm kept",
  "发黑只是她的幻术": "The darkness was just her illusion",
  "荷官小姐还是不能用魔法": "The dealer still can't use magic",
  "弹开了": "Deflected",
  "真相？": "The truth?",
  "Aschan 在利用你哦……把她的护符交给我，我帮你解开这道咒♥": "Aschan's using you, honey... Hand me her charm and I'll lift the curse♥",
  "把那枚护符交给我……这一桌，我会让你舒服地输掉的♥": "Hand me that charm... I'll make losing this table feel so good♥",
  "交给她": "Give it",
  "交出护符": "Hand over",
  "不给": "No way",
  "不交": "Keep it",
  "发牌": "Deal",
  "第 {n} 手": "Hand {n}",
  "21 点！": "21!",
  "天生 21 点": "Blackjack",
  "荷官小姐不是 21 点": "No Blackjack",
  "保险没用上 · 之后罚 {n} 秒": "Insurance wasted · +{n}s penalty later",
  "偷看": "Peek",
  "分出来的这一手 · {p} 点": "Split hand · {p}",
  "你的回合": "Your turn",
  "牌……全是 0？": "Cards... all zero?",
  "要牌，还是停牌？": "Hit or stand?",
  "分牌：两张一样的牌拆成两手，各打各的": "Split: break a pair into two hands, played separately",
  "加倍：只再拿一张就停，赢了算两胜，输了罚两倍": "Double: one more card, then stand. Win counts twice, loss costs double",
  "投降：这一手认输，只罚 {n} 秒": "Surrender: give up this hand, only {n}s penalty",
  "时间到": "Time's up",
  "荷官小姐替你要了一张": "The dealer hit for you",
  "21 点": "21",
  "第 {n} 手 · {p} 点": "Hand {n} · {p}",
  "拿一张就停 · 你 {n} 点 · 输赢都算两倍": "One card only · You: {n} · Stakes ×2",
  "自动停牌 · 你 {n} 点": "Auto-stand · You: {n}",
  "你 {n} 点": "You: {n}",
  "拆成两手，各打各的": "Two hands, played separately",
  "分 A": "Split Aces",
  "两手各补一张就停": "One card each, then stand",
  "爆牌": "Bust",
  "荷官小姐爆牌了": "Dealer busts",
  "{n} 点 · 超过 21": "{n} · Over 21",
  "两手对荷官小姐的 {d} 点": "Both hands vs. the dealer's {d}",
  "你 {p} 点 · 荷官小姐停在 {d} 点": "You: {p} · Dealer stands on {d}",
  "她要牌": "She hits",
  "荷官小姐偷看暗牌": "Dealer peeks",
  "翻牌": "Reveal",
  "明牌是 {c}……": "Up card: {c}...",
  "暗牌是……": "Hole card is...",
  "点击！": "Tap!",
  "拦住了": "Stopped!",
  "换掉了": "Swapped!",
  "点我": "Tap me",
  "丢回去了": "Tossed back",
  "长按丢掉": "Hold to toss",
  "要一直按住哦": "Keep holding~",
  "黑心": "Black heart",
  "那张是 {c} 哦♥": "That's {c}♥",
  "黑心盖着的牌，荷官小姐说了算": "Under a black heart, the dealer calls it",
  "丢不掉": "Can't toss!",
  "天生 21 点 · 赢 {w} / {n}": "Blackjack · Wins {w} / {n}",
  "赢 {w} / {n}": "Wins {w} / {n}",
  "赢了": "You win",
  "荷官小姐 21 点": "Dealer's 21",
  "输了": "You lose",
  "买了保险 · 不罚": "Insured · No penalty",
  "认输 · 罚 {n} 秒": "Surrendered · {n}s penalty",
  "你 {p} 点 · 罚 {n} 秒": "You: {p} · {n}s penalty",
  "荷官小姐 {d} 点 · 罚 {n} 秒": "Dealer: {d} · {n}s penalty",
  "平局": "Push",
  "不罚 · 再来一手": "No penalty · Next hand",
  "赢": "WIN",
  "输": "LOSE",
  "平": "PUSH",
  "爆": "BUST",
  "一胜一负": "1 win, 1 loss",
  "赢 {w} 手": "Won {w}",
  "罚 {n} 秒": "{n}s penalty",
  "罚时 {n} 秒": "Penalty {n}s",
  "保险没用上 · 撑到 0 才发下一手": "Insurance wasted · Hold to 0 for next deal",
  "撑到 0 才发下一手": "Hold out to 0 for the next deal",
  "保险": "Insurance",
  "赌荷官小姐是天生 21 点：是的话这一手不罚，不是的话罚 {n} 秒": "Bet the dealer has Blackjack: if so, no penalty this hand; if not, {n}s",
  "买": "Buy",
  "不买": "No thanks",
  "点我 +1": "Tap me +1",
  // 救济（2026-10-26）
  "又输给我了呢♥ 这已经是你第{n}次坐上这张牌桌了哦~": "Lost to me again♥ That makes {n} times at my table~",
  "每次输光了还要回来……真是让人心疼的客人呢~": "Losing everything and still coming back every time... you poor, sweet thing~",
  "只要承认自己是『离不开我牌桌的赌鬼』，就让你从输掉的那一桌重新开始哦♥": "Admit you're 『a gambler who can't leave my table』, and you can restart from the table you lost♥",
  "怎么样？承认自己是离不开我牌桌的赌鬼吗~♥": "Well? Will you admit you're a gambler who can't leave my table~?♥",
  "承认自己是赌鬼": "Admit I'm a gambling addict",
  "才不是赌鬼": "I'm no gambling addict",
  "好乖~♥ 那从今晚起，你就是我牌桌上的专属赌鬼了哦": "Good boy~♥ From tonight on, you're my table's very own gambler",
  "嘴硬的样子也很可爱~ 那就从第一桌重新来吧♥": "Acting tough is cute too~ Then start over from the first table♥",
  // 败北的提示（2026-10-27）
  "Aschan的提示": "Aschan's Tip",
  "胸口的护符忽然微微发烫，里面传出熟悉的声音。": "The charm on your chest suddenly grows warm, and a familiar voice drifts out of it.",
  "喂喂，听得到吗？……被那个荷官欺负得好惨呢，Aschan 在这边看得都坐不住了w": "Hello~ can you hear me? That dealer really got you. Aschan could barely sit still lol",
  "先别急着关掉哦。输了就老老实实点『败北』，把最后那一段看完，后面才会有人来帮你~": "Don't close it yet. When you lose, press 『Defeat』 and watch to the end—that's when help shows up~",
  "这样输满 {relief} 次，她就会问你要不要『重来这一组』，从输掉的那一桌接着打。": "Lose {relief} times and she'll offer to 『retry this set』 from the table you lost.",
  "输满 {inv} 次，还能开『无敌模式』——挑战失手也不会倒下。": "At {inv} losses, 『Invincible Mode』 opens up—missing a challenge won't take you down.",
  "不过那样赢了，可不算完成委托哦w": "Winning that way doesn't clear the quest, though lol",
  "还有，护符上那四颗魔力碎片，你是不是一颗都舍不得用？": "And those four mana shards on the charm—too stingy to use even one?",
  "想牌的时候点一下护符，手牌就多算 1 点哦。": "Tap the charm on your turn and your hand gets +1.",
  "要是还嫌不够……Aschan 帮你把护符再调一调，让碎片每到新的一桌都重新充满四颗。要吗？": "Still not enough? Aschan can tune the charm so all four shards refill every table. Want that?",
  "拜托你了": "Please do",
  "不用，我自己赢": "No, I'll win on my own",
  "嗯哼~ 交给 Aschan 吧。下一次冒险开始，碎片每一桌都会充满哦。": "Hehe~ Leave it to Aschan. Starting your next run, the shards refill at every table.",
  "赢回来以后，要先来跟 Aschan 道谢……不许先去找那个荷官，听到没有？♥": "Once you win, come thank Aschan first... No running off to that dealer before me, got it?♥",
  "好好好，有骨气~ 想要的时候，再到这里叫 Aschan 就行。": "Okay, okay, you've got guts~ If you change your mind, just call Aschan from here.",
  "护符已经帮你调好了，碎片每一桌都会充满——别省着，尽管用。": "The charm's already tuned—the shards refill every table, so don't hold back. Use them.",
  "……别被那种女人迷得太久哦。Aschan 等你赢回来w": "...Don't stay hooked on a woman like her too long. Aschan's waiting for you to win and come home lol"
}
